(5117316, 745496, 96751, '<td valign="top">I feel like this should have been shot more to the right, with more sunset and less rock.  Also, the light in the lighthouse is a bit too blown out.</td>', 'I feel like this should have been shot more to the right, with more sunset and less rock.  Also, the light in the lighthouse is a bit too blown out.', '2008-12-08 13:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
