(5119393, 745196, 88926, '<td valign="top">Well done, I like the waves and foam on the beach.</td>', 'Well done, I like the waves and foam on the beach.', '2008-12-09 12:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119399, 745620, 88926, '<td valign="top">Great photo, looking forward to finding out where this is.</td>', 'Great photo, looking forward to finding out where this is.', '2008-12-09 12:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119413, 745546, 88926, '<td valign="top">Like the big sky</td>', 'Like the big sky', '2008-12-09 12:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119673, 744201, 100540, '<td valign="top">Great Photo..!</td>', 'Great Photo..!', '2008-12-09 14:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119675, 745066, 100540, '<td valign="top">Amazing Photo..</td>', 'Amazing Photo..', '2008-12-09 14:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119714, 745461, 76598, '<td valign="top">The child makes the image,it is pretty good without him, but really neat with him, excellent composition, nice use of contrast, I wish there wasn''t the lens flare off the rocks below the sun.</td>', 'The child makes the image,it is pretty good without him, but really neat with him, excellent composition, nice use of contrast, I wish there wasn''t the lens flare off the rocks below the sun.', '2008-12-09 14:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119738, 745391, 14867, '<td valign="top">The mood is of a sunset...though the sun seems to be still very high!<br/>Nice subtlety of the light. I would consider to clone out some black dots and lines near the ducks. Good image globally.</td>', 'The mood is of a sunset...though the sun seems to be still very high!Nice subtlety of the light. I would consider to clone out some black dots and lines near the ducks. Good image globally.', '2008-12-09 14:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119753, 745485, 14867, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and the long exposure is fine (though perhaps not yet silky enough). The saturation is near the limit, but after all, it''s a sunset !</td>', 'Nicely composed, and the long exposure is fine (though perhaps not yet silky enough). The saturation is near the limit, but after all, it''s a sunset !', '2008-12-09 14:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119791, 745502, 14867, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image, it seems completely surreal, and that''s perhaps the issue. Honestly, I doubt the sky is from the same capture, the light on the mountains (or the foreground) doesn''t match the sky, and something in the sky''s sharpness vs the mountain''s and town''s sharpness is also different. I hope I''m wrong - I rate it high for the moment.<br/>If I''m wrong, you postprocessing is impressive. You could still improve it dodging the mountains - the town would better stand out.</td>', 'Fascinating image, it seems completely surreal, and that''s perhaps the issue. Honestly, I doubt the sky is from the same capture, the light on the mountains (or the foreground) doesn''t match the sky, and something in the sky''s sharpness vs the mountain''s and town''s sharpness is also different. I hope I''m wrong - I rate it high for the moment.If I''m wrong, you postprocessing is impressive. You could still improve it dodging the mountains - the town would better stand out.', '2008-12-09 15:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119794, 745150, 14867, '<td valign="top">Calm indeed, even serene. Particularly well composed. Excellent</td>', 'Calm indeed, even serene. Particularly well composed. Excellent', '2008-12-09 15:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119809, 745057, 14867, '<td valign="top">Good composition (although the pier near the horizon is a bit confusing)<br/>Unfortunately, the whole shadows seem washed out, gray more than black, and the image lacks of contrast. A simple level''s adjustment should fix that.</td>', 'Good composition (although the pier near the horizon is a bit confusing)Unfortunately, the whole shadows seem washed out, gray more than black, and the image lacks of contrast. A simple level''s adjustment should fix that.', '2008-12-09 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119812, 745161, 14867, '<td valign="top">Good subject globally, but lens flare and lack of sharpness are spoiling it. Can''t rate it very high, sorry.</td>', 'Good subject globally, but lens flare and lack of sharpness are spoiling it. Can''t rate it very high, sorry.', '2008-12-09 15:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119825, 745461, 14867, '<td valign="top">Different and rather good.<br/>Even the lens flares are in the right places!</td>', 'Different and rather good.Even the lens flares are in the right places!', '2008-12-09 15:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119833, 745434, 14867, '<td valign="top">Sunset?<br/>Seems to be at noon ! The light is way too harsh, could be better with the sun hidden by a trunk.<br/>The lens flares are very annoying here...</td>', 'Sunset?Seems to be at noon ! The light is way too harsh, could be better with the sun hidden by a trunk.The lens flares are very annoying here...', '2008-12-09 15:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119836, 745628, 14867, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant, the 2 vertical lines above the horizon (aerial) are a bit distracting (attracting the eye on something unimportant)</td>', 'Simple and elegant, the 2 vertical lines above the horizon (aerial) are a bit distracting (attracting the eye on something unimportant)', '2008-12-09 15:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119843, 745596, 14867, '<td valign="top">Superb work, the long exposure is beautiful, just as the contrasting colors. The curved horizon is the icing on the cake (fish eye ?)</td>', 'Superb work, the long exposure is beautiful, just as the contrasting colors. The curved horizon is the icing on the cake (fish eye ?)', '2008-12-09 15:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119844, 745123, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love bulls, what a great silhouette. I wish that those pipes weren''t there, but other than that I love this.</td>', 'I love bulls, what a great silhouette. I wish that those pipes weren''t there, but other than that I love this.', '2008-12-09 15:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119845, 745551, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the saturated colors and I''m a softy for silhouettes. I think if the comoposition were a little more inclusive (More sun and smaller silhouette) it might be even more intriguing.</td>', 'I like the saturated colors and I''m a softy for silhouettes. I think if the comoposition were a little more inclusive (More sun and smaller silhouette) it might be even more intriguing.', '2008-12-09 15:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119847, 745444, 98141, '<td valign="top">There''s something very calm about this, with the sky being more blue than sunset-y (I like to invent words). I think a more defined treeline would do it more justice.</td>', 'There''s something very calm about this, with the sky being more blue than sunset-y (I like to invent words). I think a more defined treeline would do it more justice.', '2008-12-09 15:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119850, 745333, 98141, '<td valign="top">Stunning! I love the cooler tones in this, all the blue is great, and the city scape is nice and sharp.</td>', 'Stunning! I love the cooler tones in this, all the blue is great, and the city scape is nice and sharp.', '2008-12-09 15:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119852, 745075, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the way that the land seems to be reaching out to the sun.</td>', 'I like the composition, the way that the land seems to be reaching out to the sun.', '2008-12-09 15:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119853, 745363, 93927, '<td valign="top">great composition! i wish the boat in the water as in focus, but i''m sure your exposure time was long so that''s completely understandable. well done!</td>', 'great composition! i wish the boat in the water as in focus, but i''m sure your exposure time was long so that''s completely understandable. well done!', '2008-12-09 15:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119854, 745230, 93927, '<td valign="top">breathtaking!</td>', 'breathtaking!', '2008-12-09 15:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119855, 745573, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very cool, great colors, I like that the birds go all the way from one side of the frame to the other. Would be even stronger without the white speck and clouds in the sky, I think, but very well done.</td>', 'Very cool, great colors, I like that the birds go all the way from one side of the frame to the other. Would be even stronger without the white speck and clouds in the sky, I think, but very well done.', '2008-12-09 15:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119856, 745204, 14867, '<td valign="top">Strong image, the several curves of the shore and the sky make it very attractive. A bit overprocessed and oversharpened imo, but still a very good work.</td>', 'Strong image, the several curves of the shore and the sky make it very attractive. A bit overprocessed and oversharpened imo, but still a very good work.', '2008-12-09 15:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119857, 745057, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this a lot, but the contrast doesn''t feel clean to me and I find it distracting.</td>', 'I like the composition of this a lot, but the contrast doesn''t feel clean to me and I find it distracting.', '2008-12-09 15:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119859, 745312, 93927, '<td valign="top">excellent pano! i''m sure a print would be outstanding. 10</td>', 'excellent pano! i''m sure a print would be outstanding. 10', '2008-12-09 15:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119860, 745461, 93927, '<td valign="top">this is fantastic!</td>', 'this is fantastic!', '2008-12-09 15:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119861, 745635, 14867, '<td valign="top">10 for the title and 0 for the photo = 5 :)</td>', '10 for the title and 0 for the photo = 5 :)', '2008-12-09 15:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119867, 745552, 93927, '<td valign="top">wow, that swam was a nice find! i wish you could''ve gotten closer to it, it was be a wonderful shot. this is a very cool, different image. i don''t really see sunrise though..</td>', 'wow, that swam was a nice find! i wish you could''ve gotten closer to it, it was be a wonderful shot. this is a very cool, different image. i don''t really see sunrise though..', '2008-12-09 15:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119868, 745623, 98141, '<td valign="top">Feels a little dark to me and the horizon feels a bit crooked. I like the orange hues.</td>', 'Feels a little dark to me and the horizon feels a bit crooked. I like the orange hues.', '2008-12-09 15:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119869, 745205, 14867, '<td valign="top">VERY beautiful.<br/>And different !</td>', 'VERY beautiful.And different !', '2008-12-09 15:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119870, 745058, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, I love the colors in the sky and the comoposition is very interesting.</td>', 'Fantastic, I love the colors in the sky and the comoposition is very interesting.', '2008-12-09 15:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119871, 745552, 98141, '<td valign="top">While nothing about this screams sunrise to me, I do very much like the composition and if you say it was at sunrise, I''m going to take your word for it :)</td>', 'While nothing about this screams sunrise to me, I do very much like the composition and if you say it was at sunrise, I''m going to take your word for it :)', '2008-12-09 15:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119873, 745088, 98141, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors, wonderful composition. I love it.</td>', 'Amazing colors, wonderful composition. I love it.', '2008-12-09 15:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119875, 745570, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like that we can see the sun rays on the tops of the trees. That said, this does feel like it''s lacking something to me, perhaps it''s a little dark in the foreground?</td>', 'I like that we can see the sun rays on the tops of the trees. That said, this does feel like it''s lacking something to me, perhaps it''s a little dark in the foreground?', '2008-12-09 15:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119877, 745204, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I don''t care for the frame, but I think the picture is dramatic.</td>', 'Beautiful. I don''t care for the frame, but I think the picture is dramatic.', '2008-12-09 15:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119878, 745603, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the green and the reddish orange of the sky. This feels very Halloween to me. I wish it were a bit sharper.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the green and the reddish orange of the sky. This feels very Halloween to me. I wish it were a bit sharper.', '2008-12-09 15:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119879, 745564, 14867, '<td valign="top">Low rated, sorry: neat image (or another denoise-filter) is way over the limit here (making almost invisible the bridge''s cables, for example</td>', 'Low rated, sorry: neat image (or another denoise-filter) is way over the limit here (making almost invisible the bridge''s cables, for example', '2008-12-09 15:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119881, 745602, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and relaxing. I''d like to see it with a more inclusive composition as well (tops of the tree and side of the tree included in the frame).</td>', 'Beautiful and relaxing. I''d like to see it with a more inclusive composition as well (tops of the tree and side of the tree included in the frame).', '2008-12-09 15:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119885, 744834, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. I''d like if the branches on the left were closer to the camera and included more or if they were not in the picture at all, as they are I find them a little distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. I''d like if the branches on the left were closer to the camera and included more or if they were not in the picture at all, as they are I find them a little distracting.', '2008-12-09 15:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119886, 744605, 14867, '<td valign="top">Great harmony, a delight</td>', 'Great harmony, a delight', '2008-12-09 15:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119887, 744974, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very calm, relaxing. I think the bird looks fantastic.</td>', 'Very calm, relaxing. I think the bird looks fantastic.', '2008-12-09 15:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119888, 744907, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ooh, very cool, I like the colors in this a lot, as well as the clarity of the buildings.</td>', 'Ooh, very cool, I like the colors in this a lot, as well as the clarity of the buildings.', '2008-12-09 15:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119889, 745601, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fantastic reflection shot, just beautiful.</td>', 'Fantastic reflection shot, just beautiful.', '2008-12-09 15:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119890, 745191, 98141, '<td valign="top">Haunting, but doesn''t really represent sunset/sunrise to me - feels more like moonrise? I like the comoposition a lot.</td>', 'Haunting, but doesn''t really represent sunset/sunrise to me - feels more like moonrise? I like the comoposition a lot.', '2008-12-09 15:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119893, 744935, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea, the execution is very nicely done.</td>', 'Very cool idea, the execution is very nicely done.', '2008-12-09 15:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119898, 745393, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, I like that you filled the bottom of the frame completely with their mechanical skeletons.</td>', 'I like this a lot, I like that you filled the bottom of the frame completely with their mechanical skeletons.', '2008-12-09 15:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119902, 745125, 98141, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t feel sad to me, it feels refreshing and I like the crispness of it.</td>', 'This doesn''t feel sad to me, it feels refreshing and I like the crispness of it.', '2008-12-09 15:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119909, 745355, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting idea, I think I''d connect with it more if the person were facing the camera and it acted more as a back light?</td>', 'Interesting lighting idea, I think I''d connect with it more if the person were facing the camera and it acted more as a back light?', '2008-12-09 15:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119911, 745476, 98141, '<td valign="top">Feels very grainy/oof or something to me, but I love the colors and the composition.</td>', 'Feels very grainy/oof or something to me, but I love the colors and the composition.', '2008-12-09 15:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119915, 745616, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes, I''d like to see a version without the fence in at the bottom so the flowers look like they''re really growing into the sky.</td>', 'Nice silhouettes, I''d like to see a version without the fence in at the bottom so the flowers look like they''re really growing into the sky.', '2008-12-09 15:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119919, 745600, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the texture of the clouds, but the rest of the pic feels either too dark or not dark enough (a silhouette would have looked nice, I think, but the fact that we can see some detail makes it feel dark accidentally, imo).</td>', 'I love the texture of the clouds, but the rest of the pic feels either too dark or not dark enough (a silhouette would have looked nice, I think, but the fact that we can see some detail makes it feel dark accidentally, imo).', '2008-12-09 15:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119922, 745596, 88501, '<td valign="top">Is this La Jolla - I have photos from the stop this was taken I think - your is better though... :)  .....  :(</td>', 'Is this La Jolla - I have photos from the stop this was taken I think - your is better though... :)  .....  :(', '2008-12-09 15:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119923, 745448, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I love the contrast of the trees with the steam.</td>', 'Great composition, I love the contrast of the trees with the steam.', '2008-12-09 15:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119928, 745353, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, if nothing out it stands out because it is different than all the other entries I have seen thus far in this challenge.</td>', 'Interesting photo, if nothing out it stands out because it is different than all the other entries I have seen thus far in this challenge.', '2008-12-09 15:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119929, 745230, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, nice composition and great colors.</td>', 'Beautiful, nice composition and great colors.', '2008-12-09 15:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119934, 744757, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the vastness of this, it makes me feel so small.</td>', 'I like the vastness of this, it makes me feel so small.', '2008-12-09 15:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119937, 745634, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great clarity and sharpness this has to it!</td>', 'Wow, what a great clarity and sharpness this has to it!', '2008-12-09 15:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119941, 745446, 98141, '<td valign="top">It feels a little oversaturated to me, but lucky for you I like a little bit of oversaturation :) I think the firey colors in this are great.</td>', 'It feels a little oversaturated to me, but lucky for you I like a little bit of oversaturation :) I think the firey colors in this are great.', '2008-12-09 15:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119944, 745524, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, great sharpness to the edge of the silhouette.</td>', 'Fantastic shot, great sharpness to the edge of the silhouette.', '2008-12-09 15:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119947, 745572, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the moon being up there and the person among the rocks, it''s almost like a Where''s Waldo shot trying to find him/her!</td>', 'I like the moon being up there and the person among the rocks, it''s almost like a Where''s Waldo shot trying to find him/her!', '2008-12-09 15:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119951, 745033, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the fog in the foreground, the composition is lovely, a great depth to this.</td>', 'I love the fog in the foreground, the composition is lovely, a great depth to this.', '2008-12-09 15:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119952, 745065, 98141, '<td valign="top">Another great silhouette, nice composition and use of natural framing. Great colors, too.</td>', 'Another great silhouette, nice composition and use of natural framing. Great colors, too.', '2008-12-09 15:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119953, 745312, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is great, the clouds are so powerful looking in this, I almost feel like they''re about to challenge the city to a duel of Mother Nature vs. Civilization (for the record, I think Mother Nature would win).</td>', 'Wow, this is great, the clouds are so powerful looking in this, I almost feel like they''re about to challenge the city to a duel of Mother Nature vs. Civilization (for the record, I think Mother Nature would win).', '2008-12-09 15:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119958, 745327, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this, just a quiet neighborhood waking up in the morning, but something is lacking in the execution of it, but I can''t seem to put my finger on it. The lightpost on the left feels like it''s leaning over to me and I find that a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the idea of this, just a quiet neighborhood waking up in the morning, but something is lacking in the execution of it, but I can''t seem to put my finger on it. The lightpost on the left feels like it''s leaning over to me and I find that a bit distracting.', '2008-12-09 15:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119960, 745396, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish this were sharper. I love the colors in the sky.</td>', 'I wish this were sharper. I love the colors in the sky.', '2008-12-09 15:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119961, 745363, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I like the composition here. The pic has something about it that makes it feel very fast-paced to me.</td>', 'Ooh, I like the composition here. The pic has something about it that makes it feel very fast-paced to me.', '2008-12-09 15:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119963, 745525, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I like the simplicity of this.</td>', 'Great composition, I like the simplicity of this.', '2008-12-09 15:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119965, 745628, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette, I love the stars in the sky.</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette, I love the stars in the sky.', '2008-12-09 15:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119966, 745596, 98141, '<td valign="top">While I like the composition, the surfaces in this feel waxy to my eyes, they feel too smooth, it almost feels like a model size sunset to me.</td>', 'While I like the composition, the surfaces in this feel waxy to my eyes, they feel too smooth, it almost feels like a model size sunset to me.', '2008-12-09 16:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119974, 745523, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great idea, but I think that including the dock pole so close to the camera was a mistake. I really like the background of the pic and would love to see a version of this without the dock pole (I''m calling it that because I''m not sure what it''s really called?).</td>', 'I think this is a great idea, but I think that including the dock pole so close to the camera was a mistake. I really like the background of the pic and would love to see a version of this without the dock pole (I''m calling it that because I''m not sure what it''s really called?).', '2008-12-09 16:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119976, 745349, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, we can see the texture of the fur even in this silhouette. _Great_ DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful, we can see the texture of the fur even in this silhouette. _Great_ DOF.', '2008-12-09 16:02:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5119978, 745564, 98141, '<td valign="top">Oooh, I love the variety of colors in this, from warm to cool. Very well composed shot.</td>', 'Oooh, I love the variety of colors in this, from warm to cool. Very well composed shot.', '2008-12-09 16:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119979, 745095, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish the subject were a bit sharper.</td>', 'I wish the subject were a bit sharper.', '2008-12-09 16:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119980, 745620, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love love love the colors in this, especially the green on the rocks.</td>', 'I love love love the colors in this, especially the green on the rocks.', '2008-12-09 16:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119982, 745445, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great clouds, lucky you. The colors and contrast in this are stellar.</td>', 'Great clouds, lucky you. The colors and contrast in this are stellar.', '2008-12-09 16:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119985, 745587, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the person/camera silhouette in this, nice composition.</td>', 'I like the person/camera silhouette in this, nice composition.', '2008-12-09 16:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119988, 745196, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish the foreground were a bit sharper, nothing really feels in focus to me.</td>', 'I wish the foreground were a bit sharper, nothing really feels in focus to me.', '2008-12-09 16:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119991, 745450, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very nice depth to this. It feels a little dark to me. I''d like to see a version with less water and more focus on the mountains and sky.</td>', 'Very nice depth to this. It feels a little dark to me. I''d like to see a version with less water and more focus on the mountains and sky.', '2008-12-09 16:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119995, 744937, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very much a painting, great capture. I love the blue in the sky to contrast the firey colors of the sunset.</td>', 'Very much a painting, great capture. I love the blue in the sky to contrast the firey colors of the sunset.', '2008-12-09 16:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5119999, 745637, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like pictures that have mountain ranges that are closer and further from each other (if that makes any sense) so that we can see the different shades of shadow.</td>', 'I like pictures that have mountain ranges that are closer and further from each other (if that makes any sense) so that we can see the different shades of shadow.', '2008-12-09 16:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120001, 745437, 98141, '<td valign="top">Man, what I would give for a Florida winter right now! I don''t care much for the composition tbh, I''d like to see the subject moved more off-center I think.</td>', 'Man, what I would give for a Florida winter right now! I don''t care much for the composition tbh, I''d like to see the subject moved more off-center I think.', '2008-12-09 16:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120004, 745435, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is the first pink sunrise I''ve seen so far in this challenge, and I find it refreshing. Very nice Easter hues in this.</td>', 'This is the first pink sunrise I''ve seen so far in this challenge, and I find it refreshing. Very nice Easter hues in this.', '2008-12-09 16:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120008, 745571, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the motion of the water contrasted with the stillness of stone. Great earth tones in this.</td>', 'I love the motion of the water contrasted with the stillness of stone. Great earth tones in this.', '2008-12-09 16:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120011, 745509, 98141, '<td valign="top">Looks like the birds are eating all your fish! I usually don''t care much for shots with this perspective of an aisle/road/etc. but I think the darnkess of it works well here.</td>', 'Looks like the birds are eating all your fish! I usually don''t care much for shots with this perspective of an aisle/road/etc. but I think the darnkess of it works well here.', '2008-12-09 16:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120013, 745019, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the near solid color of the sky as a backdrop for this shot, makes it feel very powerful.</td>', 'I love the near solid color of the sky as a backdrop for this shot, makes it feel very powerful.', '2008-12-09 16:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120020, 745391, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful neutral tones, very relaxing.</td>', 'Beautiful neutral tones, very relaxing.', '2008-12-09 16:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120022, 745630, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the waves in this. It feels a little dark to me, but the silhouette stands out pretty well.</td>', 'I love the waves in this. It feels a little dark to me, but the silhouette stands out pretty well.', '2008-12-09 16:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120023, 744999, 98141, '<td valign="top">The contrast feels a little fuzzy to me here. I really like the composition.</td>', 'The contrast feels a little fuzzy to me here. I really like the composition.', '2008-12-09 16:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120044, 745546, 98141, '<td valign="top">I really like the saturation here and I dig the minimal comoposition.</td>', 'I really like the saturation here and I dig the minimal comoposition.', '2008-12-09 16:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120047, 745411, 98141, '<td valign="top">It''s cool to see a shot that doesn''t have the typical sunset colors. I think if it were a little bit brighter it would stand out even more.</td>', 'It''s cool to see a shot that doesn''t have the typical sunset colors. I think if it were a little bit brighter it would stand out even more.', '2008-12-09 16:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120050, 745161, 98141, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the sun looks in this. I don''t care much for the hill silhouette though.</td>', 'I really like the way the sun looks in this. I don''t care much for the hill silhouette though.', '2008-12-09 16:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120053, 745347, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, this is a great silhouette shot imo and I really dig the composition.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, this is a great silhouette shot imo and I really dig the composition.', '2008-12-09 16:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120054, 744821, 98141, '<td valign="top">The outlines don''t feel sharp and that''s the only thing I find distracting about this pic. I love the colors in the sky, especially the purple.</td>', 'The outlines don''t feel sharp and that''s the only thing I find distracting about this pic. I love the colors in the sky, especially the purple.', '2008-12-09 16:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120058, 745416, 98141, '<td valign="top">The tree feels oof to me, would like this better if it were a bit sharper. I think the sky looks great and I like the city lights down below.</td>', 'The tree feels oof to me, would like this better if it were a bit sharper. I think the sky looks great and I like the city lights down below.', '2008-12-09 16:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120059, 745175, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the blue and the composition leaves nothing to be desired.</td>', 'Great shot, love the blue and the composition leaves nothing to be desired.', '2008-12-09 16:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120062, 744309, 98141, '<td valign="top">This feels relaxing, but not sharp enough for my tastes. I wish the surface of the water were a little clearer so we could see the texture of it and the silhouette doesn''t feel sharp to me either.</td>', 'This feels relaxing, but not sharp enough for my tastes. I wish the surface of the water were a little clearer so we could see the texture of it and the silhouette doesn''t feel sharp to me either.', '2008-12-09 16:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120065, 745296, 98141, '<td valign="top">The contrast on this feels really fuzzy to me and it''s distracting, which is a shame because I think your composition is fantastic. The mountains look great.</td>', 'The contrast on this feels really fuzzy to me and it''s distracting, which is a shame because I think your composition is fantastic. The mountains look great.', '2008-12-09 16:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120069, 745555, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is the first all-sky shot I''ve seen, and I like it. I find there''s something powerful but peaceful about it all at the same time.</td>', 'This is the first all-sky shot I''ve seen, and I like it. I find there''s something powerful but peaceful about it all at the same time.', '2008-12-09 16:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
