(5120075, 745434, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the way the sun looks in this, but the rest of the pic doesn''t feel very focused to me. I wish the little house stood out a little more.</td>', 'I like the way the sun looks in this, but the rest of the pic doesn''t feel very focused to me. I wish the little house stood out a little more.', '2008-12-09 16:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120079, 744996, 98141, '<td valign="top">I see... a nice sunset pic. I like the say the clouds make the sun look like it''s a reflection.</td>', 'I see... a nice sunset pic. I like the say the clouds make the sun look like it''s a reflection.', '2008-12-09 16:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
