(5120084, 745282, 98141, '<td valign="top">Haha, looks like after sunset he had quite a night. Good to see something different. I wish that bulb weren''t popping out a little from behind the post he''s tied up to, and the edges are a bit dark imo, but perhaps that''s part of the lamppost effect you were going for.</td>', 'Haha, looks like after sunset he had quite a night. Good to see something different. I wish that bulb weren''t popping out a little from behind the post he''s tied up to, and the edges are a bit dark imo, but perhaps that''s part of the lamppost effect you were going for.', '2008-12-09 16:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120086, 745038, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ah, finally, somebody who is suffering through the same winter as I am :) Nice composition. I''d also like to see a version with less field below the trees in the frame, I think it would help it pop even more.</td>', 'Ah, finally, somebody who is suffering through the same winter as I am :) Nice composition. I''d also like to see a version with less field below the trees in the frame, I think it would help it pop even more.', '2008-12-09 16:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120087, 745579, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is amazing, such great clarity and the lights look great.</td>', 'This is amazing, such great clarity and the lights look great.', '2008-12-09 16:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120090, 745403, 98141, '<td valign="top">All the edges feel a little blurry to me, I feel that this would be stronger if the non-reflection half were sharper. I do like the yellow, that really pops.</td>', 'All the edges feel a little blurry to me, I feel that this would be stronger if the non-reflection half were sharper. I do like the yellow, that really pops.', '2008-12-09 16:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5120092, 744713, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think the sky looks great. I''d like to see the rest of the pic with more far-reaching landscape and less foreground foliage.</td>', 'I think the sky looks great. I''d like to see the rest of the pic with more far-reaching landscape and less foreground foliage.', '2008-12-09 16:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
