(5120102, 745182, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think the sky looks great and that you''re very dedicated for getting up so early to capture a sunrise. I wish we could see a bit more of the structure, it''s a smidge too dark for me.</td>', 'I think the sky looks great and that you''re very dedicated for getting up so early to capture a sunrise. I wish we could see a bit more of the structure, it''s a smidge too dark for me.', '2008-12-09 16:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
