(5120117, 745581, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great colors, nice silhouettes. I think a including a little less water in the foreground would make the composition pop more.</td>', 'Great colors, nice silhouettes. I think a including a little less water in the foreground would make the composition pop more.', '2008-12-09 16:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
