(5124354, 744974, 57260, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! A 9 from me. I wonder how this would''ve looked if you cropped out the sky and the horizon completely and have just the silhouetted bird against the background of water. I think that would simplify the the composition even more and in simplicity there is beauty. Not that there''s anything wrong with the composition as it is. It''s wonderful.</td>', 'Beautiful! A 9 from me. I wonder how this would''ve looked if you cropped out the sky and the horizon completely and have just the silhouetted bird against the background of water. I think that would simplify the the composition even more and in simplicity there is beauty. Not that there''s anything wrong with the composition as it is. It''s wonderful.', '2008-12-11 06:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5124356, 745587, 57260, '<td valign="top">I love the crisp detail in the clouds and the sky is beautiful. Well done.</td>', 'I love the crisp detail in the clouds and the sky is beautiful. Well done.', '2008-12-11 06:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
