(5125300, 744618, 56275, '<td valign="top">I love the dreamy quality to this photo. Colors are great.</td>', 'I love the dreamy quality to this photo. Colors are great.', '2008-12-11 15:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125539, 745174, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors in the sky. There seems to be a spot in the middle of the pic (where the dark treeline is above the water) that is reflecting light in a strange way. I''m not sure what would have caused that, but I do find it distracting.</td>', 'Very nice colors in the sky. There seems to be a spot in the middle of the pic (where the dark treeline is above the water) that is reflecting light in a strange way. I''m not sure what would have caused that, but I do find it distracting.', '2008-12-11 16:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125542, 745626, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ooh, very cool colors with the sky! I''m not sure I care for the building being included in the shot.</td>', 'Ooh, very cool colors with the sky! I''m not sure I care for the building being included in the shot.', '2008-12-11 16:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125543, 745591, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m starting to really like these photography silhouettes :) Great colors! Great clarity around the silhouette edges too.</td>', 'I''m starting to really like these photography silhouettes :) Great colors! Great clarity around the silhouette edges too.', '2008-12-11 16:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125546, 745178, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and dof here a lot. The brightness and yellowsness of the sun doesn''t do much for it, imho, but if it were cropped a little tighter on top to eliminate it I think that would work really well.</td>', 'I like the composition and dof here a lot. The brightness and yellowsness of the sun doesn''t do much for it, imho, but if it were cropped a little tighter on top to eliminate it I think that would work really well.', '2008-12-11 16:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125550, 745426, 98141, '<td valign="top">Pastel sunset. I like the composition, the amount of sky that you included, but I''d like to see that bit of tree on the right gone, it''s a bit distracting to me.</td>', 'Pastel sunset. I like the composition, the amount of sky that you included, but I''d like to see that bit of tree on the right gone, it''s a bit distracting to me.', '2008-12-11 16:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125553, 744750, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great vivid colors in the sky, I love those red/orange hues, and I think you captured a good bit of detail in the houses without it being too dark or too bright - nice shot. I''d like to see a version with the lights on in the trees too maybe.</td>', 'Great vivid colors in the sky, I love those red/orange hues, and I think you captured a good bit of detail in the houses without it being too dark or too bright - nice shot. I''d like to see a version with the lights on in the trees too maybe.', '2008-12-11 16:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126162, 744775, 42013, '<td valign="top">The title is cumbersome but the picture stands on its own. Nice and subtle touch on this one.</td>', 'The title is cumbersome but the picture stands on its own. Nice and subtle touch on this one.', '2008-12-11 23:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126163, 745204, 42013, '<td valign="top">Wow, you really captured a nice moment here. The clouds are awe inspiring and I like the heavy handed contrast. Dodging is fairly noticble but I think it adds to the impact of the shot. Good luck as I think this one will be hard to top!</td>', 'Wow, you really captured a nice moment here. The clouds are awe inspiring and I like the heavy handed contrast. Dodging is fairly noticble but I think it adds to the impact of the shot. Good luck as I think this one will be hard to top!', '2008-12-11 23:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126166, 745075, 42013, '<td valign="top">Well done shot of the sea-- The only thing i''d like to see different is a shift in camera position to the left, which should open up the land masses as they recede to the horizon. Just a thought and had you tried it, you might have fallen off a cliff. :(</td>', 'Well done shot of the sea-- The only thing i''d like to see different is a shift in camera position to the left, which should open up the land masses as they recede to the horizon. Just a thought and had you tried it, you might have fallen off a cliff. :(', '2008-12-11 23:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126176, 745482, 81362, '<td valign="top">The patterns across the frosty ice surface have just the color to convey a sense of cold. Subdued non-saturated sky a nice break from the more saturated competition. If that person is walking toward the camera, another capture a few seconds later might have allowed better separation from the dark background elements.</td>', 'The patterns across the frosty ice surface have just the color to convey a sense of cold. Subdued non-saturated sky a nice break from the more saturated competition. If that person is walking toward the camera, another capture a few seconds later might have allowed better separation from the dark background elements.', '2008-12-11 23:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126177, 745391, 81362, '<td valign="top">The bright trails in the water contrast well with a dull sky, making an unexpected but artistic contribution to this challenge.</td>', 'The bright trails in the water contrast well with a dull sky, making an unexpected but artistic contribution to this challenge.', '2008-12-11 23:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126181, 745562, 81362, '<td valign="top">Having so many different bright colors in the bridge and along the streets makes for a lot of competition with the sky. For me, the clash makes this harder to look at. However, the reflected tones in that expanse of water are very nice.</td>', 'Having so many different bright colors in the bridge and along the streets makes for a lot of competition with the sky. For me, the clash makes this harder to look at. However, the reflected tones in that expanse of water are very nice.', '2008-12-11 23:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126183, 744845, 81362, '<td valign="top">Many elements of a classic seascape painting here, easy on the eyes even if not so powerful at grabbing attention. The water is captured very well.</td>', 'Many elements of a classic seascape painting here, easy on the eyes even if not so powerful at grabbing attention. The water is captured very well.', '2008-12-11 23:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126184, 745538, 81362, '<td valign="top">The spiky plants provide a stark contrast with the sky, with the simplicity making a nice graphic impact. The small leafy plant seems to break the pattern and makes me wish this could have been from a different vantage point.</td>', 'The spiky plants provide a stark contrast with the sky, with the simplicity making a nice graphic impact. The small leafy plant seems to break the pattern and makes me wish this could have been from a different vantage point.', '2008-12-12 00:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126188, 745635, 81362, '<td valign="top">Sorry to find the image just as uniform as the thumbnail suggested. I predict a low score from most voters. I''m just commenting, but I would deduct a point or two becaue this image doesn''t convey anything about sunset or sunrise and has to depend on the title for even a remote connection.</td>', 'Sorry to find the image just as uniform as the thumbnail suggested. I predict a low score from most voters. I''m just commenting, but I would deduct a point or two becaue this image doesn''t convey anything about sunset or sunrise and has to depend on the title for even a remote connection.', '2008-12-12 00:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126192, 745355, 81362, '<td valign="top">The muted puples,pinks, and blues of the sky and water might convey the challenge topic better without the person. Bright white jacket/vest and lighting of the ground and far side of the person make it more difficult to sit back and enjoy the natural setting for itself (realizing that many would find it uninteresting without the person).</td>', 'The muted puples,pinks, and blues of the sky and water might convey the challenge topic better without the person. Bright white jacket/vest and lighting of the ground and far side of the person make it more difficult to sit back and enjoy the natural setting for itself (realizing that many would find it uninteresting without the person).', '2008-12-12 00:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126198, 745088, 81362, '<td valign="top">Scrolling this to remove the upper bright white and blue parts of the sky suggests that cropping that part away could strengthen the image. Color bands and reflections across the water are very pretty.</td>', 'Scrolling this to remove the upper bright white and blue parts of the sky suggests that cropping that part away could strengthen the image. Color bands and reflections across the water are very pretty.', '2008-12-12 00:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126200, 744480, 81362, '<td valign="top">I am enjoying how you removed everything from this image excpet the sky and birds. That elevates this to a higher artistic level and makes for an image that is easy to contemplate repeatedly.</td>', 'I am enjoying how you removed everything from this image excpet the sky and birds. That elevates this to a higher artistic level and makes for an image that is easy to contemplate repeatedly.', '2008-12-12 00:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126210, 744974, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very elegant bird and reflection, with pleasing color transitions across water and sky. I think this could lose 10% from top and bottom and 15-20% from the right hand side and emerge with a stronger visual impact, but others may disagree.</td>', 'Very elegant bird and reflection, with pleasing color transitions across water and sky. I think this could lose 10% from top and bottom and 15-20% from the right hand side and emerge with a stronger visual impact, but others may disagree.', '2008-12-12 00:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126213, 745129, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good use of the bright part of sky and sunbeams to frame the flying seagull. Once I noticed the other bird in the surf, I started wondering how to get rid of it, perhaps with a judicious crop.</td>', 'Good use of the bright part of sky and sunbeams to frame the flying seagull. Once I noticed the other bird in the surf, I started wondering how to get rid of it, perhaps with a judicious crop.', '2008-12-12 00:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126215, 745439, 81362, '<td valign="top">There''s no classic reason to like this, but I do. Maybe because it gets at the essence of the sky and setting in a rather abstract way.</td>', 'There''s no classic reason to like this, but I do. Maybe because it gets at the essence of the sky and setting in a rather abstract way.', '2008-12-12 00:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126445, 745296, 93565, '<td valign="top">The cable suspending the bridge is sorta distracting to me. Colors are a bit drab for a high placing sunrise/set. Clouds have a cool texture to them though.</td>', 'The cable suspending the bridge is sorta distracting to me. Colors are a bit drab for a high placing sunrise/set. Clouds have a cool texture to them though.', '2008-12-12 07:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126446, 745419, 93565, '<td valign="top">There is some really intense noise/artifacting going on in this. Not sure I''m a fan of the atom bomb sun.</td>', 'There is some really intense noise/artifacting going on in this. Not sure I''m a fan of the atom bomb sun.', '2008-12-12 07:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126447, 745525, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice lines on the bridge, and the surface of the water is definitely neat looking. A bit of clouds would be a nice addition, but I still like this how it is.</td>', 'Nice lines on the bridge, and the surface of the water is definitely neat looking. A bit of clouds would be a nice addition, but I still like this how it is.', '2008-12-12 07:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126450, 745526, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great color. I think the silhouette works well for balancing this out. A lot of times it''s tricky to get a ratio of sky:ground, and I think the silhouette helps balance things out well.</td>', 'Great color. I think the silhouette works well for balancing this out. A lot of times it''s tricky to get a ratio of sky:ground, and I think the silhouette helps balance things out well.', '2008-12-12 07:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126451, 745524, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great luck getting the pelican just between yourself and the sun. For some reason the outline on the pelican''s back looks a bit blurred. The colors from the sun look great.</td>', 'Great luck getting the pelican just between yourself and the sun. For some reason the outline on the pelican''s back looks a bit blurred. The colors from the sun look great.', '2008-12-12 07:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126458, 745538, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the yucca for the foreground in this shot. The sky looks a tad bit oversaturated for my taste. Good choice for the border.</td>', 'I like the yucca for the foreground in this shot. The sky looks a tad bit oversaturated for my taste. Good choice for the border.', '2008-12-12 07:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126461, 745576, 93565, '<td valign="top">Perhaps its just me, but this looks overly red. Adding a bit more sky to the mix might have balanced things out a bit, as there seems to be a bit more foreground than I''d personally like.</td>', 'Perhaps its just me, but this looks overly red. Adding a bit more sky to the mix might have balanced things out a bit, as there seems to be a bit more foreground than I''d personally like.', '2008-12-12 07:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126463, 745196, 93565, '<td valign="top">The surf in this is great- the bubbles on the sand and the incoming wave. For as great as the foreground it is, it somewhat steals the show. Judging by your title though, I''m assuming you were swamped in by clouds all week but this one.</td>', 'The surf in this is great- the bubbles on the sand and the incoming wave. For as great as the foreground it is, it somewhat steals the show. Judging by your title though, I''m assuming you were swamped in by clouds all week but this one.', '2008-12-12 08:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126464, 745552, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection. I like how the idyllic swan is contrasted with the industrial steam exhaust in the background. Nice way to differentiate your shot from the rest of the photos.</td>', 'Nice reflection. I like how the idyllic swan is contrasted with the industrial steam exhaust in the background. Nice way to differentiate your shot from the rest of the photos.', '2008-12-12 08:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126466, 745349, 93565, '<td valign="top">I rather like the processing on this. Could be improved a bit, IMHO, by having more of the deer in silhouette and less consumed in the shadow. Also, a head on shot would show off the antlers a bit more.</td>', 'I rather like the processing on this. Could be improved a bit, IMHO, by having more of the deer in silhouette and less consumed in the shadow. Also, a head on shot would show off the antlers a bit more.', '2008-12-12 08:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126467, 745417, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure what I''m looking at (which isn''t bad), but there appear to be smudges and/or marks on the glass/mirror that are rather distracting from the shot.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure what I''m looking at (which isn''t bad), but there appear to be smudges and/or marks on the glass/mirror that are rather distracting from the shot.', '2008-12-12 08:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126468, 744618, 93565, '<td valign="top">The processing on this seem a bit over the top and psychadelic to me. White balance seems like it might be a bit off, due to the distinct blue cast in the bottom. Peering through the drawn curtains definitely adds a really dreamy feel to this, but the outside landscape is somewhat in contrast to this feeling because of the harsh lines.</td>', 'The processing on this seem a bit over the top and psychadelic to me. White balance seems like it might be a bit off, due to the distinct blue cast in the bottom. Peering through the drawn curtains definitely adds a really dreamy feel to this, but the outside landscape is somewhat in contrast to this feeling because of the harsh lines.', '2008-12-12 08:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126470, 745110, 93565, '<td valign="top">This shot would be more interesting if you had the sun peeking through the trees, and made the sun more of a defining aspect of your photo. Seems like you might''ve barely missed the perfect timing for the photo.</td>', 'This shot would be more interesting if you had the sun peeking through the trees, and made the sun more of a defining aspect of your photo. Seems like you might''ve barely missed the perfect timing for the photo.', '2008-12-12 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126475, 745596, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''ve always been a fan of longer exposures on the seaside. I like the rocks you''ve chosen here, but for some reason the whole shot seems a bit cramped. When I think of sunrises/sunsets, an image of a wide swath of land or sea is generally what comes to mind. Still very nice.</td>', 'I''ve always been a fan of longer exposures on the seaside. I like the rocks you''ve chosen here, but for some reason the whole shot seems a bit cramped. When I think of sunrises/sunsets, an image of a wide swath of land or sea is generally what comes to mind. Still very nice.', '2008-12-12 08:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126478, 745541, 93565, '<td valign="top">This looks really similar to where I live (Colorado). These shots are really neat, but insanely  difficult to keep your foreground illuminated without totally blowing out the skies. You did a good job keeping your clouds from getting blown out, but I would prefer if the foreground had a bit more of an adjustment from curves.</td>', 'This looks really similar to where I live (Colorado). These shots are really neat, but insanely  difficult to keep your foreground illuminated without totally blowing out the skies. You did a good job keeping your clouds from getting blown out, but I would prefer if the foreground had a bit more of an adjustment from curves.', '2008-12-12 08:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126480, 745636, 93565, '<td valign="top">The cloud cover has a little bit too strong of a presence for me, and I''d prefer if the colors were a bit more vibrant.</td>', 'The cloud cover has a little bit too strong of a presence for me, and I''d prefer if the colors were a bit more vibrant.', '2008-12-12 08:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126481, 745338, 93565, '<td valign="top">The intensity of the red on this almost makes focusing on it difficult for my eyes. I like the background, but wonder if you might''ve been better off focusing on the left prominance and changing your perspective so that the canyon and right prominence weren''t intruding in the frame. Of course, I have no clue what''s to the left, so maybe there''s a giant high tension power line screwing up that whole suggestion.</td>', 'The intensity of the red on this almost makes focusing on it difficult for my eyes. I like the background, but wonder if you might''ve been better off focusing on the left prominance and changing your perspective so that the canyon and right prominence weren''t intruding in the frame. Of course, I have no clue what''s to the left, so maybe there''s a giant high tension power line screwing up that whole suggestion.', '2008-12-12 08:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126482, 745628, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the more minimalist approach, especially with the dead/leafless tree on the left. It frames things nicely.</td>', 'I like the more minimalist approach, especially with the dead/leafless tree on the left. It frames things nicely.', '2008-12-12 08:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126484, 745585, 93565, '<td valign="top">Excellent placing the bush right on the bush. Title is a bit cliche, and I had a feeling I knew what it would before even reading it. The cloud cover is great, and the transition from orange to blue is beautiful. The combination of the clouds and the small sliver of earth makes this scene all the more grand. Great job!</td>', 'Excellent placing the bush right on the bush. Title is a bit cliche, and I had a feeling I knew what it would before even reading it. The cloud cover is great, and the transition from orange to blue is beautiful. The combination of the clouds and the small sliver of earth makes this scene all the more grand. Great job!', '2008-12-12 08:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126488, 745539, 93565, '<td valign="top">I think that having the two trees in such close proximity sorta makes them fight for the viewer''s attention, especially because they are both cut off on the edges. They kinda seem like they were an inconvenience to you and not something you wanted in the shot, but had no way around.</td>', 'I think that having the two trees in such close proximity sorta makes them fight for the viewer''s attention, especially because they are both cut off on the edges. They kinda seem like they were an inconvenience to you and not something you wanted in the shot, but had no way around.', '2008-12-12 08:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126507, 744811, 93565, '<td valign="top">The processing on this strikes me as being kinda odd initially, but also very cool. The clouds really like as though they are on fire. This makes me think of the cover of a movie or maybe a comic book or something.</td>', 'The processing on this strikes me as being kinda odd initially, but also very cool. The clouds really like as though they are on fire. This makes me think of the cover of a movie or maybe a comic book or something.', '2008-12-12 08:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126519, 744480, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like how minimalist this is. The silhouettes of the birds are great, and the color of the sky, though it appears to be induced by WB or PP, is great in contrast. The churning clouds are really what make this though. The emptiness in the top right helps to draw the viewer from the top right on down through the photo.</td>', 'I like how minimalist this is. The silhouettes of the birds are great, and the color of the sky, though it appears to be induced by WB or PP, is great in contrast. The churning clouds are really what make this though. The emptiness in the top right helps to draw the viewer from the top right on down through the photo.', '2008-12-12 08:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126730, 745474, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the light and shadows in this a lot. It feel a little unsharp to me, but I don''t think that it takes away from the photo in this instance.</td>', 'I like the light and shadows in this a lot. It feel a little unsharp to me, but I don''t think that it takes away from the photo in this instance.', '2008-12-12 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126731, 745568, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, love this! Great clarity and great depth to it, just fantastic!</td>', 'Ooooh, love this! Great clarity and great depth to it, just fantastic!', '2008-12-12 10:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126732, 745417, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the atypical approach to the subject.</td>', 'I like the atypical approach to the subject.', '2008-12-12 10:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126738, 745576, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great hues here, I love the power in this. I hope your eyes are okay after photographing it! :D</td>', 'Great hues here, I love the power in this. I hope your eyes are okay after photographing it! :D', '2008-12-12 10:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126740, 745066, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, great depth and texture here, this is fantastic, I love the bright blues. Nice composition too.</td>', 'Wow, great depth and texture here, this is fantastic, I love the bright blues. Nice composition too.', '2008-12-12 10:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126742, 744480, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is really cool, I dig the perspective, it feels a little awkward in an interesting/engaging kind of way.</td>', 'This is really cool, I dig the perspective, it feels a little awkward in an interesting/engaging kind of way.', '2008-12-12 10:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126743, 744283, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great colors and nice composition, I wish the silhouettes were a little sharper, perhaps there was a little wind and a long exposure? The ones down in front seem a little blurry.</td>', 'Great colors and nice composition, I wish the silhouettes were a little sharper, perhaps there was a little wind and a long exposure? The ones down in front seem a little blurry.', '2008-12-12 10:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126749, 745482, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very wintery hues, I like the guy walking along the path. I only think I''d like ti better if the trees had a bit more depth to them, that is if the ones in front were a bit brighter/seperate from the taller ones in back.</td>', 'Very wintery hues, I like the guy walking along the path. I only think I''d like ti better if the trees had a bit more depth to them, that is if the ones in front were a bit brighter/seperate from the taller ones in back.', '2008-12-12 11:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126750, 744144, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ooh, you captured it! It was all clouds and I didn''t even get to see it :( Fantastic colors and nice composition, also a goot brightness on the celestial objects.</td>', 'Ooh, you captured it! It was all clouds and I didn''t even get to see it :( Fantastic colors and nice composition, also a goot brightness on the celestial objects.', '2008-12-12 11:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126752, 744791, 98141, '<td valign="top">All the edges are a little too soft for me, and I don''t think the sign adds anything to the pic. Good colors in the sky.</td>', 'All the edges are a little too soft for me, and I don''t think the sign adds anything to the pic. Good colors in the sky.', '2008-12-12 11:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126753, 744775, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of the trees along the bank, great depth. This feels so fresh and wintery, you did a good job of capturing the scene.</td>', 'I love the composition of the trees along the bank, great depth. This feels so fresh and wintery, you did a good job of capturing the scene.', '2008-12-12 11:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126760, 745489, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting here is great, but I wish that it was a little sharper.</td>', 'I think the lighting here is great, but I wish that it was a little sharper.', '2008-12-12 11:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126766, 745579, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent details and nice use of the cityscape to add interest</td>', 'excellent details and nice use of the cityscape to add interest', '2008-12-12 11:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126769, 745461, 67152, '<td valign="top">love it - the feel is outstanding - the placement of the boy opposite the sun really balances out the image</td>', 'love it - the feel is outstanding - the placement of the boy opposite the sun really balances out the image', '2008-12-12 11:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126770, 745525, 67152, '<td valign="top">great light on the bridge - the sun just seems a bit too far left...</td>', 'great light on the bridge - the sun just seems a bit too far left...', '2008-12-12 11:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126774, 745587, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely capture of the clouds - and the silhouette works nicely here</td>', 'lovely capture of the clouds - and the silhouette works nicely here', '2008-12-12 11:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126779, 745204, 67152, '<td valign="top">Killer image - lovely all around! among my favorites in the challenge</td>', 'Killer image - lovely all around! among my favorites in the challenge', '2008-12-12 11:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126782, 745566, 67152, '<td valign="top">there were a lot of you out there taking shots this morning...</td>', 'there were a lot of you out there taking shots this morning...', '2008-12-12 11:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126786, 745333, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the bold graphic feel of this one</td>', 'i like the bold graphic feel of this one', '2008-12-12 11:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126789, 745291, 67152, '<td valign="top">it could be a painting</td>', 'it could be a painting', '2008-12-12 11:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126795, 745205, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like your choice here - the use of the sun to emphasize but not overwhelm the image</td>', 'i like your choice here - the use of the sun to emphasize but not overwhelm the image', '2008-12-12 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126798, 745480, 67152, '<td valign="top">the mist makes the photo</td>', 'the mist makes the photo', '2008-12-12 11:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126801, 745572, 67152, '<td valign="top">the reflection of the water to emphasize the color of the sky really makes the photo</td>', 'the reflection of the water to emphasize the color of the sky really makes the photo', '2008-12-12 11:14:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5126804, 744713, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice scene - but the colors seem hypersaturated - especially in the grasses and undergrowth</td>', 'nice scene - but the colors seem hypersaturated - especially in the grasses and undergrowth', '2008-12-12 11:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126805, 745035, 67152, '<td valign="top">i can feel the warmth of the sun</td>', 'i can feel the warmth of the sun', '2008-12-12 11:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126828, 745635, 98939, '<td valign="top">What is this! there''s nothing here!</td>', 'What is this! there''s nothing here!', '2008-12-12 11:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126831, 745230, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the glow on the rocks, the details in the foreground, and the chop of the water</td>', 'love the glow on the rocks, the details in the foreground, and the chop of the water', '2008-12-12 11:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126834, 745141, 67152, '<td valign="top">a great take on early morning light</td>', 'a great take on early morning light', '2008-12-12 11:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126838, 745541, 67152, '<td valign="top">what a dramatic sky - i think this one would be outstanding as a large print</td>', 'what a dramatic sky - i think this one would be outstanding as a large print', '2008-12-12 11:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126941, 745204, 65858, '<td valign="top">Simply lovely!</td>', 'Simply lovely!', '2008-12-12 12:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126943, 745230, 65858, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2008-12-12 12:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126983, 744586, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, nice composition. The reflection of the light off the bottom of the clouds (the bright bit near the horizon) is really stellar.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, nice composition. The reflection of the light off the bottom of the clouds (the bright bit near the horizon) is really stellar.', '2008-12-12 12:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126987, 744603, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''d like it better if the silhouettes of the cows were a bit more seperated instead of on top of one another - great lighting and colors, especially on the water.</td>', 'I''d like it better if the silhouettes of the cows were a bit more seperated instead of on top of one another - great lighting and colors, especially on the water.', '2008-12-12 12:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126989, 745538, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love that pink hue, so vibrant and energetic. Interesting subject and nice composition, this really has some energy to it!</td>', 'I love that pink hue, so vibrant and energetic. Interesting subject and nice composition, this really has some energy to it!', '2008-12-12 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126993, 745485, 98141, '<td valign="top">Just stunning. There''s a really nice contrast between the cool tones of the water and the vibrant, warm hues of the sky along the horizon.</td>', 'Just stunning. There''s a really nice contrast between the cool tones of the water and the vibrant, warm hues of the sky along the horizon.', '2008-12-12 12:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126995, 745392, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like that there are a couple of examples that aren''t just of a skyline. Good job captureing the contrast between the shadow and the light. I think it could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'I like that there are a couple of examples that aren''t just of a skyline. Good job captureing the contrast between the shadow and the light. I think it could be a bit sharper.', '2008-12-12 12:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126997, 745423, 98141, '<td valign="top">I very much like the cactus in this, in fact I think if there were more cacti along the horizon it would look even cooler. It does seem a bit dark up top to me.</td>', 'I very much like the cactus in this, in fact I think if there were more cacti along the horizon it would look even cooler. It does seem a bit dark up top to me.', '2008-12-12 12:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127002, 745451, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great dof. I love the way that shadows work in this to add depth and different hues.</td>', 'Great dof. I love the way that shadows work in this to add depth and different hues.', '2008-12-12 12:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127005, 744817, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ha, this is cool, really nice composition. It''s like they all got together to watch a movie, and the sun is the show.</td>', 'Ha, this is cool, really nice composition. It''s like they all got together to watch a movie, and the sun is the show.', '2008-12-12 12:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127007, 745433, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like how dark the hues get near the top. I think the composition is really nice, though if we could see a bit more of the treetops that would work well too.</td>', 'I like how dark the hues get near the top. I think the composition is really nice, though if we could see a bit more of the treetops that would work well too.', '2008-12-12 12:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127009, 745141, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice. This gives the feeling of dawn light without the use of a horizon, which is kind of refreshing in this challenge. I love the winter hues in this and think the composition is good.</td>', 'Nice. This gives the feeling of dawn light without the use of a horizon, which is kind of refreshing in this challenge. I love the winter hues in this and think the composition is good.', '2008-12-12 12:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127012, 745313, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, nice composition. I think the pastelish colors really work nice with a silhouette and the plant adds interest to a horizon pic.</td>', 'Cool idea, nice composition. I think the pastelish colors really work nice with a silhouette and the plant adds interest to a horizon pic.', '2008-12-12 12:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127014, 744286, 98141, '<td valign="top">Superbright, I hope your eyes are okay after taking this :) I think the colors are fantastic and I enjoy the composition as well.</td>', 'Superbright, I hope your eyes are okay after taking this :) I think the colors are fantastic and I enjoy the composition as well.', '2008-12-12 12:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127015, 745110, 98141, '<td valign="top">To me I think this needs to be sharper to really make a statement. I do like the composition.</td>', 'To me I think this needs to be sharper to really make a statement. I do like the composition.', '2008-12-12 12:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127018, 745620, 811, '<td valign="top">ooo, you''ve gotten some achoo green on the rocks.  overall, a very nice shot.</td>', 'ooo, you''ve gotten some achoo green on the rocks.  overall, a very nice shot.', '2008-12-12 12:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127019, 744201, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, super cool! Very different from anything I''ve seen yet, and I like it a lot, especially how the light comes through the end of the feathers. Would love to learn how you did this.</td>', 'Wow, super cool! Very different from anything I''ve seen yet, and I like it a lot, especially how the light comes through the end of the feathers. Would love to learn how you did this.', '2008-12-12 12:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127023, 745440, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, great depth and textures, it almost seems like the sun is exploding right out of the factory. I like the colors too. Just really nice.</td>', 'Wow, great depth and textures, it almost seems like the sun is exploding right out of the factory. I like the colors too. Just really nice.', '2008-12-12 12:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127027, 745580, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great texture on the water and the blue of the sky in the upper right is to die for, really nice.</td>', 'Great texture on the water and the blue of the sky in the upper right is to die for, really nice.', '2008-12-12 12:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127030, 744356, 98141, '<td valign="top">Most depressing pic of the lot :( But, a really nice pic and different to be sure. I hope everybody is okay after this!</td>', 'Most depressing pic of the lot :( But, a really nice pic and different to be sure. I hope everybody is okay after this!', '2008-12-12 12:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127033, 745282, 811, '<td valign="top">weird.  :)</td>', 'weird.  :)', '2008-12-12 12:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127035, 745112, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the lights contrasted with the warm colors of the sky, I think that works really well.</td>', 'I like the color of the lights contrasted with the warm colors of the sky, I think that works really well.', '2008-12-12 12:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127038, 745199, 98141, '<td valign="top">Oooh, great pic! Great texture in the clouds and the lighting on the back side of them is really cool. I also like that we can see the rays extending out from the sun and the path of light across the water from the sun to the camera, it''s like we''re being welcomed to the horizon.</td>', 'Oooh, great pic! Great texture in the clouds and the lighting on the back side of them is really cool. I also like that we can see the rays extending out from the sun and the path of light across the water from the sun to the camera, it''s like we''re being welcomed to the horizon.', '2008-12-12 12:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127041, 744973, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very smooth flow from water to horizon to sky, very calm. Nice composition. I feel like the boats out there really give this shot a story to tell rather than just being a pic of the horizon.</td>', 'Very smooth flow from water to horizon to sky, very calm. Nice composition. I feel like the boats out there really give this shot a story to tell rather than just being a pic of the horizon.', '2008-12-12 12:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127043, 745315, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think that you have a great contrast and great colors in this, it''s not too dark in the trees, good job. I like the rays coming off the sun and the bridge in the distance, a really nice feeling of depth here.</td>', 'I think that you have a great contrast and great colors in this, it''s not too dark in the trees, good job. I like the rays coming off the sun and the bridge in the distance, a really nice feeling of depth here.', '2008-12-12 12:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127047, 745629, 98141, '<td valign="top">It''s very simple. To me this is a nice pic, but it doesn''t really tell a story, which would make it an even better pic. Perhaps if the cloud were shaped like something cool.</td>', 'It''s very simple. To me this is a nice pic, but it doesn''t really tell a story, which would make it an even better pic. Perhaps if the cloud were shaped like something cool.', '2008-12-12 12:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127050, 745520, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, great firey colors in this, it''s the passion of the sky! Really nice composition and I love the black clouds against such saturated hues!</td>', 'Wow, great firey colors in this, it''s the passion of the sky! Really nice composition and I love the black clouds against such saturated hues!', '2008-12-12 12:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127057, 745430, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this in an abstract sort of way, I think the colors are interesting and I like the darkness of the clouds.</td>', 'I like this in an abstract sort of way, I think the colors are interesting and I like the darkness of the clouds.', '2008-12-12 12:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127062, 745159, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is a little too dark for me, I wish the background were a bit brighter so the colors stood out more. Also, I th in kthat if it were just the outline of the tree it would be a bit more iconic.</td>', 'This is a little too dark for me, I wish the background were a bit brighter so the colors stood out more. Also, I th in kthat if it were just the outline of the tree it would be a bit more iconic.', '2008-12-12 12:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127068, 745035, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think it''s cool how in the top bit the sun is above the tree, but in the reflection it''s right in the center of the tree''s reflection. To me, that composition tells a story about the connection between the tree and the sun: while the sun shines down from above the tree, it is giving the tree life and helping it grown from the inside out.</td>', 'I think it''s cool how in the top bit the sun is above the tree, but in the reflection it''s right in the center of the tree''s reflection. To me, that composition tells a story about the connection between the tree and the sun: while the sun shines down from above the tree, it is giving the tree life and helping it grown from the inside out.', '2008-12-12 12:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127075, 745635, 98141, '<td valign="top">Lol, very funny :)</td>', 'Lol, very funny :)', '2008-12-12 12:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127077, 745502, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think the mountains blend in a lot with the city skyline, and I''m not sure if I like that or not. I will contemplate on it and come back to vote later. I do like the color tones in this a lot. ETA: turns out I like it :)</td>', 'I think the mountains blend in a lot with the city skyline, and I''m not sure if I like that or not. I will contemplate on it and come back to vote later. I do like the color tones in this a lot. ETA: turns out I like it :)', '2008-12-12 12:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127079, 745480, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool mist shot, I like the composition and the colors turned out really nice, very subdued but not dull.</td>', 'Cool mist shot, I like the composition and the colors turned out really nice, very subdued but not dull.', '2008-12-12 12:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127263, 744775, 32378, '<td valign="top">Even though this doesn''t have the sun in it like many of the others.  I love the tonality of this shot.</td>', 'Even though this doesn''t have the sun in it like many of the others.  I love the tonality of this shot.', '2008-12-12 14:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127270, 745526, 99155, '<td valign="top">I have to say that figure is kinda creeping me out. not sure why... nice sunset though.</td>', 'I have to say that figure is kinda creeping me out. not sure why... nice sunset though.', '2008-12-12 14:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127274, 745635, 47791, '<td valign="top">Ha ha made me laugh</td>', 'Ha ha made me laugh', '2008-12-12 14:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127280, 745499, 99155, '<td valign="top">I like this but the hint of green in the corner seems to be in limbo. maybe it should have gone further one way or the other.</td>', 'I like this but the hint of green in the corner seems to be in limbo. maybe it should have gone further one way or the other.', '2008-12-12 14:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127299, 744996, 99155, '<td valign="top">I see boats. Nice picture, but i think the saturation is a little over done.</td>', 'I see boats. Nice picture, but i think the saturation is a little over done.', '2008-12-12 14:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127302, 745502, 99155, '<td valign="top">The Atlantic ocean. I feel the city and the mountains are blending together too much. I think the city ate the mountains.</td>', 'The Atlantic ocean. I feel the city and the mountains are blending together too much. I think the city ate the mountains.', '2008-12-12 14:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127440, 745282, 9462, '<td valign="top">I love your comical approach to the theme but it seems a tad oversharpened, especially for an image that suggests a blurry recollection.</td>', 'I love your comical approach to the theme but it seems a tad oversharpened, especially for an image that suggests a blurry recollection.', '2008-12-12 15:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127619, 745572, 42013, '<td valign="top">The cloud diagonal makes the shot for me.</td>', 'The cloud diagonal makes the shot for me.', '2008-12-12 17:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127621, 745347, 42013, '<td valign="top">Some haloing is evident around your foreground and the shooter. I Dig the colors and am sorry you have to live near the fog(at least it looks like fog)</td>', 'Some haloing is evident around your foreground and the shooter. I Dig the colors and am sorry you have to live near the fog(at least it looks like fog)', '2008-12-12 17:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127623, 745349, 42013, '<td valign="top">Sweet silhouette shot. love the matrix of branches in the BG.</td>', 'Sweet silhouette shot. love the matrix of branches in the BG.', '2008-12-12 17:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127627, 745291, 42013, '<td valign="top">Alright JD, enough of your perfect water and silky smooth skies! :) One of the best I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Alright JD, enough of your perfect water and silky smooth skies! :) One of the best I''ve seen so far.', '2008-12-12 18:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127631, 745580, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the flurry of movement in the water. slightly off-kilter but not a big deal.</td>', 'I like the flurry of movement in the water. slightly off-kilter but not a big deal.', '2008-12-12 18:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127635, 745568, 42013, '<td valign="top">nicely composed and you must have used Grad ND or shadow/highlights to good use.</td>', 'nicely composed and you must have used Grad ND or shadow/highlights to good use.', '2008-12-12 18:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127636, 745620, 42013, '<td valign="top">You get my ribbon for this challenge. Looks like a sweet place! Good luck!</td>', 'You get my ribbon for this challenge. Looks like a sweet place! Good luck!', '2008-12-12 18:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127639, 744935, 42013, '<td valign="top">Kudos for your creativity(and execution). 9</td>', 'Kudos for your creativity(and execution). 9', '2008-12-12 18:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127644, 745571, 42013, '<td valign="top">I hope you will share some processing details when the challenge ends. I love  the subtle tones of your shot!</td>', 'I hope you will share some processing details when the challenge ends. I love  the subtle tones of your shot!', '2008-12-12 18:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127645, 745499, 42013, '<td valign="top">Wish you had just a touch more foreground detail. Still, nicely done.</td>', 'Wish you had just a touch more foreground detail. Still, nicely done.', '2008-12-12 18:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127647, 745315, 42013, '<td valign="top">It feels tilted but I don''t think it is. Lovely golden light. Good luck!</td>', 'It feels tilted but I don''t think it is. Lovely golden light. Good luck!', '2008-12-12 18:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127651, 744817, 42013, '<td valign="top">Can''t help but love this one. Over the top processing on the foreground bird but it works by giving the sunset a cartoonish feel. Good luck!</td>', 'Can''t help but love this one. Over the top processing on the foreground bird but it works by giving the sunset a cartoonish feel. Good luck!', '2008-12-12 18:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127697, 745551, 60173, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunset colors, but that could be said for most of the challenge entries. The color that really grabs me from this shot is actually the teal on the water and how it blends as it goes to the right side of the photo.<br/> <br/>The legs do get lost in the black foreground. I think if you had lowered the camera a bit it might have looked a little better.</td>', 'Lovely sunset colors, but that could be said for most of the challenge entries. The color that really grabs me from this shot is actually the teal on the water and how it blends as it goes to the right side of the photo. The legs do get lost in the black foreground. I think if you had lowered the camera a bit it might have looked a little better.', '2008-12-12 18:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127787, 744201, 60173, '<td valign="top">Love the silhouette! <br/> <br/>My first instinct is to turn my head. I realize that turning the image clockwise would dump the poor guy''s nest, but it''s a much more eye pleasing photo that way. You know that the nest would be crooked, but others don''t. Add a vignette to balance what is now the left side of the photo, and blamo! <br/> <br/>I think you''ll finish strongly no matter what, because of the silhouette, colors, and texture.</td>', 'Love the silhouette!  My first instinct is to turn my head. I realize that turning the image clockwise would dump the poor guy''s nest, but it''s a much more eye pleasing photo that way. You know that the nest would be crooked, but others don''t. Add a vignette to balance what is now the left side of the photo, and blamo!  I think you''ll finish strongly no matter what, because of the silhouette, colors, and texture.', '2008-12-12 20:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127789, 745430, 101394, '<td valign="top">gorgeous colors!</td>', 'gorgeous colors!', '2008-12-12 20:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127792, 745626, 101394, '<td valign="top"><i><b>I love the angle!</b></i></td>', 'I love the angle!', '2008-12-12 20:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127800, 745461, 60173, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The setting alone would have been, eh. Adding the child element takes the photo to great heights.<br/> <br/>The weird blob on the bottom left is terribly distracting. I would have cloned that out.</td>', 'Very nice. The setting alone would have been, eh. Adding the child element takes the photo to great heights. The weird blob on the bottom left is terribly distracting. I would have cloned that out.', '2008-12-12 20:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127813, 745355, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m currently going through a vignette fascination, so I may have tried the same approach with this edit. However, looking at it as someone who didn''t do the edit, I think in this instance it would have been better to not use one. She''s out in the wilderness, but the vignette seems to make it feel cramped. <br/> <br/>Similar to the unspoken rule of color vs temperature. Reds are associated with warmth and blues with cold, so you don''t generally want a winter scene with a red hue. Unless the mood you''re going for is cramped or constrained, I''d say there''s probably a similar rule to not use vignettes when out in the vast wilderness.<br/> <br/>The subject in this case will draw attention to herself thanks to your flash illuminating her. There''s not really a need to use the vignette to direct the viewer.</td>', 'I''m currently going through a vignette fascination, so I may have tried the same approach with this edit. However, looking at it as someone who didn''t do the edit, I think in this instance it would have been better to not use one. She''s out in the wilderness, but the vignette seems to make it feel cramped.  Similar to the unspoken rule of color vs temperature. Reds are associated with warmth and blues with cold, so you don''t generally want a winter scene with a red hue. Unless the mood you''re going for is cramped or constrained, I''d say there''s probably a similar rule to not use vignettes when out in the vast wilderness. The subject in this case will draw attention to herself thanks to your flash illuminating her. There''s not really a need to use the vignette to direct the viewer.', '2008-12-12 20:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127818, 745635, 60173, '<td valign="top">I was actually considering an idea similar to this. I live in Oregon, and we don''t get to see the sun much this time of year. Mine would have been gray hazy skies.</td>', 'I was actually considering an idea similar to this. I live in Oregon, and we don''t get to see the sun much this time of year. Mine would have been gray hazy skies.', '2008-12-12 20:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127824, 744286, 60173, '<td valign="top">I love that huge red halo! I really hope you post all of your settings for this shot. Was the area foggy at all?</td>', 'I love that huge red halo! I really hope you post all of your settings for this shot. Was the area foggy at all?', '2008-12-12 20:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5127895, 744286, 100385, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good composition. Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot, good composition. Well done.', '2008-12-12 21:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
