(5128162, 745546, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like the clouds on this, and the way the orange/red slowly fade into blue. The whispy cirrus clouds add a great dreamy feel to things.</td>', 'I really like the clouds on this, and the way the orange/red slowly fade into blue. The whispy cirrus clouds add a great dreamy feel to things.', '2008-12-13 01:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128193, 744586, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this. If I were suggest anything, it would be to either keep the house as a total silhouette or increase its visibility, because as it is, it''s somewhat in the middle, as is a small object on the far right in the foreground.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this. If I were suggest anything, it would be to either keep the house as a total silhouette or increase its visibility, because as it is, it''s somewhat in the middle, as is a small object on the far right in the foreground.', '2008-12-13 02:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128194, 744974, 93565, '<td valign="top">I love how serene things are. Totally deserted lake and the very calming lavender color of the sky make this a very relaxing image.</td>', 'I love how serene things are. Totally deserted lake and the very calming lavender color of the sky make this a very relaxing image.', '2008-12-13 02:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128196, 745161, 93565, '<td valign="top">Seems like your camera got a bit overwhelmed by the brightness on this one. I would''ve liked to see more detail in the clouds.</td>', 'Seems like your camera got a bit overwhelmed by the brightness on this one. I would''ve liked to see more detail in the clouds.', '2008-12-13 02:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128201, 744356, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo. I especially like the small water droplets/mist coming off the water stream. The smoke is also pretty neat. Unfortunately, I don''t really think this is a sunrise, due to how high the sun is in the photo, so perhaps this isn''t the best challenge for this submission.</td>', 'This is a cool photo. I especially like the small water droplets/mist coming off the water stream. The smoke is also pretty neat. Unfortunately, I don''t really think this is a sunrise, due to how high the sun is in the photo, so perhaps this isn''t the best challenge for this submission.', '2008-12-13 03:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128207, 745451, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''ve always though that it''s cool when people get the edges of the sun to be ragged like that. The color is so vibrant it looks almost like a sunset on Mars or something. The way that the different "rows" of trees fade into each other is very cool.</td>', 'I''ve always though that it''s cool when people get the edges of the sun to be ragged like that. The color is so vibrant it looks almost like a sunset on Mars or something. The way that the different "rows" of trees fade into each other is very cool.', '2008-12-13 03:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128219, 745621, 93565, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the shot. I think some things could have been improved in the execution though- the sky is almost entirely blown out, and the prompt for the challenge is sunset, so I feel like there should be more attention given to keeping some detail in the sunset itself.</td>', 'Good idea for the shot. I think some things could have been improved in the execution though- the sky is almost entirely blown out, and the prompt for the challenge is sunset, so I feel like there should be more attention given to keeping some detail in the sunset itself.', '2008-12-13 03:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128228, 744935, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m not terribly fond of the use of a star filter on this, personally.</td>', 'I''m not terribly fond of the use of a star filter on this, personally.', '2008-12-13 03:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128229, 745572, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the small details in this. The moon, Venus?, and the fisherman are all smaller objects that add nicely. The line of clouds diagonally across the frame is nice too. I would''ve maybe liked this a tad brighter to bring out the beach a bit more, but it''s still nice.</td>', 'I like the small details in this. The moon, Venus?, and the fisherman are all smaller objects that add nicely. The line of clouds diagonally across the frame is nice too. I would''ve maybe liked this a tad brighter to bring out the beach a bit more, but it''s still nice.', '2008-12-13 03:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128231, 745182, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like all the colors, and the use of the pipe leading towards the sunset is a nice touch. I would''ve liked a bit wider swatch illuminated on the center, but the isolation is kinda cool too.</td>', 'I really like all the colors, and the use of the pipe leading towards the sunset is a nice touch. I would''ve liked a bit wider swatch illuminated on the center, but the isolation is kinda cool too.', '2008-12-13 03:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128309, 744757, 93565, '<td valign="top">Your depiction of the mountains is great! I think that since there isn''t a whole lot going on in the sky it looks a bit empty, and that even though this was a sunrise/sunset challenge, it might have almost been better to include a bit less sky.</td>', 'Your depiction of the mountains is great! I think that since there isn''t a whole lot going on in the sky it looks a bit empty, and that even though this was a sunrise/sunset challenge, it might have almost been better to include a bit less sky.', '2008-12-13 07:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128312, 745199, 93565, '<td valign="top">The saturation of the colors, combined with the contrast, give this a bit of a fake appearance, imho.</td>', 'The saturation of the colors, combined with the contrast, give this a bit of a fake appearance, imho.', '2008-12-13 07:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128314, 745579, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great cityscape. I like how the waterway meanders off into the distance. Getting a bit more of the actual sun would have been a plus.</td>', 'Great cityscape. I like how the waterway meanders off into the distance. Getting a bit more of the actual sun would have been a plus.', '2008-12-13 07:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128319, 745066, 93565, '<td valign="top">The sky looks oversaturated. I like the pier stretching off into the distance. Also, not sure if it was intentional on you''ve got some light vignetting going on.</td>', 'The sky looks oversaturated. I like the pier stretching off into the distance. Also, not sure if it was intentional on you''ve got some light vignetting going on.', '2008-12-13 07:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128321, 745568, 93565, '<td valign="top">The colors of this one remind me of another entry- the landscape is almost so red that it makes it difficult for me to focus on. I really like the clouds and the colors they are bathed in. Perhaps a bit of an adjustment to brighten things up a bit would be good.</td>', 'The colors of this one remind me of another entry- the landscape is almost so red that it makes it difficult for me to focus on. I really like the clouds and the colors they are bathed in. Perhaps a bit of an adjustment to brighten things up a bit would be good.', '2008-12-13 07:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128328, 745433, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like the clouds here- they looks almost like pink lace, or really thin flakes.</td>', 'I really like the clouds here- they looks almost like pink lace, or really thin flakes.', '2008-12-13 07:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128331, 745445, 93565, '<td valign="top">The color and texture of the water is awesome. My only gripe is that the certain shades of orange seem to be a bit oversaturated. Nice photo.</td>', 'The color and texture of the water is awesome. My only gripe is that the certain shades of orange seem to be a bit oversaturated. Nice photo.', '2008-12-13 07:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128333, 744603, 93565, '<td valign="top">Your border choice was good on this, and I like the idyllic country scene here. Looks like you had some badluck with the behavior of the cloud cover, unfortunately.</td>', 'Your border choice was good on this, and I like the idyllic country scene here. Looks like you had some badluck with the behavior of the cloud cover, unfortunately.', '2008-12-13 07:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128335, 744834, 93565, '<td valign="top">Going with the rock silhouette was a good choice, but I think the bush/tree on the left should either not be there, or be more prominent in the shot. As it is, it seems like a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'Going with the rock silhouette was a good choice, but I think the bush/tree on the left should either not be there, or be more prominent in the shot. As it is, it seems like a bit of a distraction.', '2008-12-13 07:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128338, 744976, 93565, '<td valign="top">I think it''s good that you tried to integrate something other than just the sunset into the challenge, but the sky looks like its wrinkled! What is that? Were you shooting through a window?</td>', 'I think it''s good that you tried to integrate something other than just the sunset into the challenge, but the sky looks like its wrinkled! What is that? Were you shooting through a window?', '2008-12-13 07:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128369, 745296, 7910, '<td valign="top">way too much noise or too high iso setting here, not to mention the 2 lines cutting right across the image.</td>', 'way too much noise or too high iso setting here, not to mention the 2 lines cutting right across the image.', '2008-12-13 07:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128375, 744169, 7910, '<td valign="top">Very creative for this type of challenge, and refreshing to see.  I like it.  1 minor note:  on my monitor I can see a little light on the goat... would have been better as a complete silhouette.</td>', 'Very creative for this type of challenge, and refreshing to see.  I like it.  1 minor note:  on my monitor I can see a little light on the goat... would have been better as a complete silhouette.', '2008-12-13 07:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
