(5128487, 744144, 100393, '<td valign="top">Fantastic - I love the way you have included the Moon, Venus and Jupiter alignment in this shot - and with an interesting foreground too. I hope you ribbon.</td>', 'Fantastic - I love the way you have included the Moon, Venus and Jupiter alignment in this shot - and with an interesting foreground too. I hope you ribbon.', '2008-12-13 09:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
