(5128496, 745552, 100393, '<td valign="top">I gave a low score so I should justify it.<br/> <br/>Not badly executed but for me, the subject isn''t the greatest and you would need some really creative editing to bring more interest to the scene.</td>', 'I gave a low score so I should justify it. Not badly executed but for me, the subject isn''t the greatest and you would need some really creative editing to bring more interest to the scene.', '2008-12-13 09:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128497, 745347, 100975, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2008-12-13 09:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128499, 745570, 100393, '<td valign="top">I gave a low score so I should justify it. I think the black point has been set too high which makes the cow look flat, there is a good deal of noise in the face of the cow too. Also, there are some blown highlights in the upper branches of the tree. All correctable.<br/> <br/>Composition-wise I think chopping off the top of the tree doesn''t do a lot for the image. Goodness me I''ve said too much, and actually I''m not good enough myself to be so bold with my critique; but I do think I should justify my score.<br/> <br/>Subject-wise, I think there would be quite a lot of potential here but a lot of it goes unrealised.</td>', 'I gave a low score so I should justify it. I think the black point has been set too high which makes the cow look flat, there is a good deal of noise in the face of the cow too. Also, there are some blown highlights in the upper branches of the tree. All correctable. Composition-wise I think chopping off the top of the tree doesn''t do a lot for the image. Goodness me I''ve said too much, and actually I''m not good enough myself to be so bold with my critique; but I do think I should justify my score. Subject-wise, I think there would be quite a lot of potential here but a lot of it goes unrealised.', '2008-12-13 09:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128500, 745066, 100975, '<td valign="top">Nice location for a shot, but I am not digging the clouds very much in this one.</td>', 'Nice location for a shot, but I am not digging the clouds very much in this one.', '2008-12-13 09:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128501, 744618, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''ve given a low mark so I should justify it.<br/> <br/>I''m sure you knew when you submitted this shot that not everyone would like it and I hold my hand up to that. There looks to be some really interesting buildings out there and I''d have liked to have seen more of them.<br/> <br/>The whole effect reminds me of an old Cokin ''Dreams'' filter I had years ago coupled with way too much saturation in post-processing.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry I don''t like it, but having given a low score, you deserve an explanation.</td>', 'I''ve given a low mark so I should justify it. I''m sure you knew when you submitted this shot that not everyone would like it and I hold my hand up to that. There looks to be some really interesting buildings out there and I''d have liked to have seen more of them. The whole effect reminds me of an old Cokin ''Dreams'' filter I had years ago coupled with way too much saturation in post-processing. I''m sorry I don''t like it, but having given a low score, you deserve an explanation.', '2008-12-13 09:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128502, 745296, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''ve given this a low mark so I should justify it. Composition wise, it looks like it needs straightening. The hills are in silhouette and as such would probably look better with an upwards shift of the black point. <br/> <br/>The clouds are very nice in shape but I am sure that with a bit of attention to the blue and red saturation levels, they could look a lot better. Also is that a naval dockyard in the foreground? If so I''d like to have seen more.</td>', 'I''ve given this a low mark so I should justify it. Composition wise, it looks like it needs straightening. The hills are in silhouette and as such would probably look better with an upwards shift of the black point.  The clouds are very nice in shape but I am sure that with a bit of attention to the blue and red saturation levels, they could look a lot better. Also is that a naval dockyard in the foreground? If so I''d like to have seen more.', '2008-12-13 09:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128503, 745444, 100393, '<td valign="top">I gave a low score so I should justify it. Although the sky is pretty - the shot doesn''t say ''composed'' to me. The field(?) to the left and the street lamp are too apparent to be ignored yet they are not really presented as part of the image either.<br/> <br/>I think had you cropped down to the right hand side of this image, played with the saturation and perhaps shadows levels, you may have gotten a good shot from this exposure, but for me it looks a bit ''point-and-shoot'' to live with the competition in this challenge.</td>', 'I gave a low score so I should justify it. Although the sky is pretty - the shot doesn''t say ''composed'' to me. The field(?) to the left and the street lamp are too apparent to be ignored yet they are not really presented as part of the image either. I think had you cropped down to the right hand side of this image, played with the saturation and perhaps shadows levels, you may have gotten a good shot from this exposure, but for me it looks a bit ''point-and-shoot'' to live with the competition in this challenge.', '2008-12-13 09:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128504, 745629, 100393, '<td valign="top">I gave a low score so I should justify it. This is an OK image but I don''t find there is enough here to interest the eye and it doesn''t score too well on the difficulty tariff either.</td>', 'I gave a low score so I should justify it. This is an OK image but I don''t find there is enough here to interest the eye and it doesn''t score too well on the difficulty tariff either.', '2008-12-13 09:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128505, 745476, 100393, '<td valign="top">I gave a low score, so I should justify it. Too over-processed to me. The sky is pretty dramatic which is good but the green halo around the sun detracts a lot from the image; makes the whole concept look to be pushed too far.</td>', 'I gave a low score, so I should justify it. Too over-processed to me. The sky is pretty dramatic which is good but the green halo around the sun detracts a lot from the image; makes the whole concept look to be pushed too far.', '2008-12-13 09:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128506, 745327, 100393, '<td valign="top">I have given a low score so I should justify it. For me, I think this is a bit of a non-starter composition wise.</td>', 'I have given a low score so I should justify it. For me, I think this is a bit of a non-starter composition wise.', '2008-12-13 09:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128507, 744834, 100975, '<td valign="top">May have cropped out most of the sky on top (the really soft part) and possibly moved over about a foot before I took the picture to remove the tree from the shot.</td>', 'May have cropped out most of the sky on top (the really soft part) and possibly moved over about a foot before I took the picture to remove the tree from the shot.', '2008-12-13 09:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5128508, 745593, 100975, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but the sky is too distracting.  It pulls your eyes in too many directions.</td>', 'Good shot, but the sky is too distracting.  It pulls your eyes in too many directions.', '2008-12-13 09:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
