(5129234, 745520, 99448, '<td valign="top">love it, great shot</td>', 'love it, great shot', '2008-12-13 17:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129236, 745525, 99448, '<td valign="top">OMG, nice one</td>', 'OMG, nice one', '2008-12-13 17:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129237, 745629, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like that you chose to concentrate on the color in the clouds without other objects: 9</td>', 'I like that you chose to concentrate on the color in the clouds without other objects: 9', '2008-12-13 17:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129238, 745593, 62187, '<td valign="top">That''s a hell of a sunset: 10</td>', 'That''s a hell of a sunset: 10', '2008-12-13 17:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129239, 745570, 62187, '<td valign="top">Extremely daring!</td>', 'Extremely daring!', '2008-12-13 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129241, 744935, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, it looks like a cartoon. A very good one though and I kinda like it but it seems more about the ''Treasure'' leaving the Sun in second place.</td>', 'To me, it looks like a cartoon. A very good one though and I kinda like it but it seems more about the ''Treasure'' leaving the Sun in second place.', '2008-12-13 17:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129243, 745617, 101271, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition!  I love this shot.  Congrats and thanks for sharing this!</td>', 'Fantastic composition!  I love this shot.  Congrats and thanks for sharing this!', '2008-12-13 17:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129244, 745174, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been perfect if not for that line in the water. Maybe you could have cropped it different?</td>', 'I think it would have been perfect if not for that line in the water. Maybe you could have cropped it different?', '2008-12-13 17:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129245, 745445, 62187, '<td valign="top">Even though this one has water and a jetty, to me, it''s more about the sunset then anything else. Very nice! I think it''s a comparable photo to mine which is at 5.6 - I''m giving your photo an 8</td>', 'Even though this one has water and a jetty, to me, it''s more about the sunset then anything else. Very nice! I think it''s a comparable photo to mine which is at 5.6 - I''m giving your photo an 8', '2008-12-13 17:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129246, 744937, 62187, '<td valign="top">I see that you mean Light Show - it looks funny as Lightshow. I wanted to make it Lights how at first. Anyway, great sunset! 10</td>', 'I see that you mean Light Show - it looks funny as Lightshow. I wanted to make it Lights how at first. Anyway, great sunset! 10', '2008-12-13 17:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129248, 745603, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s almost like the sunset/rise is a secondary subject. But, the color of it is very powerful and brings it to equality to the rest of the photo: 9</td>', 'It''s almost like the sunset/rise is a secondary subject. But, the color of it is very powerful and brings it to equality to the rest of the photo: 9', '2008-12-13 17:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129249, 745461, 62187, '<td valign="top">Obviously it was taken at sunrise/sunset but to me the photo is a very good photo of a boy playing in the sand: not the sun.</td>', 'Obviously it was taken at sunrise/sunset but to me the photo is a very good photo of a boy playing in the sand: not the sun.', '2008-12-13 17:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129250, 744907, 101271, '<td valign="top">Superb depth, color and detail!</td>', 'Superb depth, color and detail!', '2008-12-13 17:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129251, 745630, 62187, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the sun in the sand give your excellent photo an edge over many of the others: 10</td>', 'The reflection of the sun in the sand give your excellent photo an edge over many of the others: 10', '2008-12-13 17:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129252, 745555, 62187, '<td valign="top">Thanks for sticking with the subject of the challenge!</td>', 'Thanks for sticking with the subject of the challenge!', '2008-12-13 17:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129253, 745112, 62187, '<td valign="top">I thought the challenge was about the sun and not lamps. The colors are very contrasting together and have a nice eye-appeal.</td>', 'I thought the challenge was about the sun and not lamps. The colors are very contrasting together and have a nice eye-appeal.', '2008-12-13 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129259, 745123, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like my photo much better then I like yours. Mine is currently at 5.6. I like the blue in the snow and your optimism - especially in this economy! I''ll score your photo at 7</td>', 'I like my photo much better then I like yours. Mine is currently at 5.6. I like the blue in the snow and your optimism - especially in this economy! I''ll score your photo at 7', '2008-12-13 17:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129261, 745363, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice photo that is obviously taken at sunset/sunrise (yes, I see it says sunset) but to me, the photo is about anything BUT the sun and all about the buildings and the Ferris wheel.</td>', 'It''s a very nice photo that is obviously taken at sunset/sunrise (yes, I see it says sunset) but to me, the photo is about anything BUT the sun and all about the buildings and the Ferris wheel.', '2008-12-13 17:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129264, 745525, 62187, '<td valign="top">A nice photo that was obviously taken at sunset/sunrise but seems to be more about a bridge and water.</td>', 'A nice photo that was obviously taken at sunset/sunrise but seems to be more about a bridge and water.', '2008-12-13 17:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129265, 743984, 62187, '<td valign="top">Weird purple border but nice balance between trees and sunset. Scoring it higher then my entry: 8</td>', 'Weird purple border but nice balance between trees and sunset. Scoring it higher then my entry: 8', '2008-12-13 17:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129267, 745509, 62187, '<td valign="top">Even though the decking and water are more then half of the photo, the sunset totally overpowers them. I''d have give the photo a 10 except for a strange halo I am seeing around the sun. So...? 9</td>', 'Even though the decking and water are more then half of the photo, the sunset totally overpowers them. I''d have give the photo a 10 except for a strange halo I am seeing around the sun. So...? 9', '2008-12-13 17:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129270, 745445, 101271, '<td valign="top">Very VERY nicely done!</td>', 'Very VERY nicely done!', '2008-12-13 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129272, 744356, 101271, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail in the water stream!  Well done indeed!</td>', 'Excellent detail in the water stream!  Well done indeed!', '2008-12-13 17:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129275, 745191, 62187, '<td valign="top">If it would have been possible to put the silhouette of the building closer to the light, I think it would have made a more dramatic effect. As is, it''s still pretty cool.</td>', 'If it would have been possible to put the silhouette of the building closer to the light, I think it would have made a more dramatic effect. As is, it''s still pretty cool.', '2008-12-13 17:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129278, 745312, 62187, '<td valign="top">The light is pretty long for sure but the last thing I thought of when I looked at this photo was ''sunset/sunrise''. I thought, wow, what cool photo of a city.</td>', 'The light is pretty long for sure but the last thing I thought of when I looked at this photo was ''sunset/sunrise''. I thought, wow, what cool photo of a city.', '2008-12-13 17:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129279, 745349, 62187, '<td valign="top">Totally excellent focus!</td>', 'Totally excellent focus!', '2008-12-13 17:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129280, 744713, 62187, '<td valign="top">Just some slight haloing that I see. Oh well...10</td>', 'Just some slight haloing that I see. Oh well...10', '2008-12-13 17:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129281, 744707, 62187, '<td valign="top">This screams Jo to me but no matter how good I think the photo is, it doesn''t make me think of a sunrise or a sunset. It will however, probably beat the socks off my obvious photo of a sunset.</td>', 'This screams Jo to me but no matter how good I think the photo is, it doesn''t make me think of a sunrise or a sunset. It will however, probably beat the socks off my obvious photo of a sunset.', '2008-12-13 18:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129283, 744976, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nothing about this excellent photo is saying ''sunset/sunrise'' to me.</td>', 'Nothing about this excellent photo is saying ''sunset/sunrise'' to me.', '2008-12-13 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129413, 745396, 62187, '<td valign="top">A lovely sunset that I wish was a bit crisper. Awesome colors!</td>', 'A lovely sunset that I wish was a bit crisper. Awesome colors!', '2008-12-13 20:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129415, 745552, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna have to believe you on that...what a brave soul!</td>', 'I''m gonna have to believe you on that...what a brave soul!', '2008-12-13 20:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129423, 745450, 62187, '<td valign="top">Either underexposed or a filter used - maybe darkened in photoshop? Anyway, I''ll bet this one got better as it got later - or maybe earlier? The clouds in the lower right are really, really strange looking...kinda cool</td>', 'Either underexposed or a filter used - maybe darkened in photoshop? Anyway, I''ll bet this one got better as it got later - or maybe earlier? The clouds in the lower right are really, really strange looking...kinda cool', '2008-12-13 20:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129424, 745499, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, it looks like a daytime shot that was under exposed or darkened.</td>', 'To me, it looks like a daytime shot that was under exposed or darkened.', '2008-12-13 20:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129429, 745420, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid it won''t fair too well but I still like it''s starkness.</td>', 'I''m afraid it won''t fair too well but I still like it''s starkness.', '2008-12-13 20:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129434, 745626, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very unnatural looking. Brilliant colors just unnatural to me. The focus and composition are well done.</td>', 'Very unnatural looking. Brilliant colors just unnatural to me. The focus and composition are well done.', '2008-12-13 20:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129436, 744356, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well that just sucks! I hope everybody was ok - nice capture.</td>', 'Well that just sucks! I hope everybody was ok - nice capture.', '2008-12-13 20:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129442, 745634, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, the building and ocean do not overpower the sunset as some of the other photos.</td>', 'To me, the building and ocean do not overpower the sunset as some of the other photos.', '2008-12-13 20:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129452, 745199, 62187, '<td valign="top">Freakin'' perfect! I hope you sat with some tea to watch this. Get it? Long Island Tea? What is that anyway? Well, I do know the photo is trophy: 10</td>', 'Freakin'' perfect! I hope you sat with some tea to watch this. Get it? Long Island Tea? What is that anyway? Well, I do know the photo is trophy: 10', '2008-12-13 20:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129454, 745065, 62187, '<td valign="top">The reds and yellows look like they are pushed a little to far to me.</td>', 'The reds and yellows look like they are pushed a little to far to me.', '2008-12-13 20:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129459, 745353, 62187, '<td valign="top">I really like it - very different: 9</td>', 'I really like it - very different: 9', '2008-12-13 20:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129463, 744973, 62187, '<td valign="top">I wonder if anybody told you the poles in the water are distracting. Apparently the branches in mine are. Anyway, no doubt about it, it''s a 10.</td>', 'I wonder if anybody told you the poles in the water are distracting. Apparently the branches in mine are. Anyway, no doubt about it, it''s a 10.', '2008-12-13 20:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129467, 745524, 62187, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool capture!</td>', 'Pretty cool capture!', '2008-12-13 20:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129473, 745282, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s an super excellent photo and a terrible thing to happen to somebody, but I can''t take it seriously for this challenge...</td>', 'It''s an super excellent photo and a terrible thing to happen to somebody, but I can''t take it seriously for this challenge...', '2008-12-13 20:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129475, 744605, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s almost more about the rocks and water...</td>', 'It''s almost more about the rocks and water...', '2008-12-13 20:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129482, 745635, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, there have been some brave souls during this challenge. So far, I think your the bravest!</td>', 'Well, there have been some brave souls during this challenge. So far, I think your the bravest!', '2008-12-13 20:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5129488, 745520, 62187, '<td valign="top">What an awesome show nature provided you and an awesome job behind the camera: 10</td>', 'What an awesome show nature provided you and an awesome job behind the camera: 10', '2008-12-13 20:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
