(5131123, 745617, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like standard high scoring stuff. Nice catch of the sun shining through the open rafters.</td>', 'Looks like standard high scoring stuff. Nice catch of the sun shining through the open rafters.', '2008-12-14 23:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5131130, 745444, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a little dull for a sunrise shot, but I popped it into my paint app out of curiosity, and found some quick adjustments of levels, curves and contrast really made this pop off the screen.</td>', 'Seems a little dull for a sunrise shot, but I popped it into my paint app out of curiosity, and found some quick adjustments of levels, curves and contrast really made this pop off the screen.', '2008-12-14 23:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5131133, 745312, 83313, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been liking the use of HDR in this challenge, but you did this one well. I''m impressed that you were able to not only use the HDR look effectively, but you were able to get an awful lot of detail packed into a narrow panoramic view. I''d love to see a larger view of this one if you could post it somehwere. A fave.</td>', 'I haven''t been liking the use of HDR in this challenge, but you did this one well. I''m impressed that you were able to not only use the HDR look effectively, but you were able to get an awful lot of detail packed into a narrow panoramic view. I''d love to see a larger view of this one if you could post it somehwere. A fave.', '2008-12-14 23:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5131137, 745439, 83313, '<td valign="top">This entry screams "<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous</a>" to me. Blurry, and bleary, but in an appealing way. Very different from the rest of the challenge.</td>', 'This entry screams " Posthumous" to me. Blurry, and bleary, but in an appealing way. Very different from the rest of the challenge.', '2008-12-14 23:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5131139, 745635, 54645, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is great! I love simple composition. You really nailed the low key.</td>', 'Wow! This is great! I love simple composition. You really nailed the low key.', '2008-12-14 23:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5131141, 745564, 54645, '<td valign="top">Good luck Jack!</td>', 'Good luck Jack!', '2008-12-14 23:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5131142, 745489, 83313, '<td valign="top">I guess the sun breaking out would be a sunrise of sorts. Or you are near the pole. I would not have know this was midday if you had not said so. I''m curious of why you thought to alert the voter to what will surely be perceived as DNMC. There''s someting I''m not getting, but I do like the way the sun is striking these trees.</td>', 'I guess the sun breaking out would be a sunrise of sorts. Or you are near the pole. I would not have know this was midday if you had not said so. I''m curious of why you thought to alert the voter to what will surely be perceived as DNMC. There''s someting I''m not getting, but I do like the way the sun is striking these trees.', '2008-12-14 23:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5131144, 745562, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit soft to me. Not sure exactly what it is and what to suggest, though.</td>', 'Seems a bit soft to me. Not sure exactly what it is and what to suggest, though.', '2008-12-14 23:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5131147, 744787, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a wildfire raging.</td>', 'Looks like a wildfire raging.', '2008-12-14 23:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5131149, 745033, 54645, '<td valign="top">What can I say, stunning scene. Great work with the sky and star burst. To be honest, I fell the composition could have been stronger, but I do not know the limitations you were under when shooting. To me, this is a scene that would be benefit from more scenery on the left or right with then sun left or right. If I cover the screen and crop three finger breadths off I feel the scene is more dynamic, with the light, clouds, mist, and mountain drifting off to the right, as if they are starting the day together. Overall very pleasing photograph with room for growth. Cheers!</td>', 'What can I say, stunning scene. Great work with the sky and star burst. To be honest, I fell the composition could have been stronger, but I do not know the limitations you were under when shooting. To me, this is a scene that would be benefit from more scenery on the left or right with then sun left or right. If I cover the screen and crop three finger breadths off I feel the scene is more dynamic, with the light, clouds, mist, and mountain drifting off to the right, as if they are starting the day together. Overall very pleasing photograph with room for growth. Cheers!', '2008-12-14 23:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5131150, 745282, 83313, '<td valign="top">This has to get one of my shoehorn awards for unexpected humor in a serious challenge. I hope there is a good story here... <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737192" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737192.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737192.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737192.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This has to get one of my shoehorn awards for unexpected humor in a serious challenge. I hope there is a good story here... ', '2008-12-14 23:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
