(5131204, 745635, 3020, '<td valign="top">Wow, seriously guys. I thought the entry was humorous but I never thought in a million years I would get any degree to the comments I received nor that people would accept my humor. You have proven once and for all that the score of a photo means little compared to the comments it receives and judging by those comments this entry was pure gold. So I thank you, I am very honored.<br/> <br/>Wow, look at that graph, never seen that before, that is just crazy! xD<br/></td>', 'Wow, seriously guys. I thought the entry was humorous but I never thought in a million years I would get any degree to the comments I received nor that people would accept my humor. You have proven once and for all that the score of a photo means little compared to the comments it receives and judging by those comments this entry was pure gold. So I thank you, I am very honored. Wow, look at that graph, never seen that before, that is just crazy! xD', '2008-12-15 00:08:58.000000', NULL, 0),
