(5131945, 745141, 84438, '<td valign="top">The biggest compliment I can give this photo is that it''s DIFFERENT than the rest in this challenge.  Good on you for not entering the cliched oversaturated sunset with long exposure waves.<br/> <br/>I also notice that this was taken in Banff, one of the most beautiful locations in Canada, which in my opinion makes it even more impressive that you entered a shot like this.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry that I didn''t vote in this challenge, because I would have given this a 9.  Excellent photo.</td>', 'The biggest compliment I can give this photo is that it''s DIFFERENT than the rest in this challenge.  Good on you for not entering the cliched oversaturated sunset with long exposure waves. I also notice that this was taken in Banff, one of the most beautiful locations in Canada, which in my opinion makes it even more impressive that you entered a shot like this. I''m sorry that I didn''t vote in this challenge, because I would have given this a 9.  Excellent photo.', '2008-12-15 09:44:29.000000', NULL, 0),
