(5132077, 745417, 68947, '<td valign="top">That''s what you get for wandering out with your camera, half nude, slippers and hair uncombed, half asleep to take a shot! *grin, wink*  <br/> <br/>Actually, for a "mistaken entry" you got a pretty decent score and comments!  I don''t get this when I really like an entry and have spent hours trying!!! *smile*<br/> <br/>ETA:  I''m laughing here because even KNOWING this is a mirror from your notes...I still can''t tell that it is, let alone....seeing "smudges" on the mirror! ROFLMAO!!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-15 10:55:40.</i></td>', 'That''s what you get for wandering out with your camera, half nude, slippers and hair uncombed, half asleep to take a shot! *grin, wink*   Actually, for a "mistaken entry" you got a pretty decent score and comments!  I don''t get this when I really like an entry and have spent hours trying!!! *smile* ETA:  I''m laughing here because even KNOWING this is a mirror from your notes...I still can''t tell that it is, let alone....seeing "smudges" on the mirror! ROFLMAO!!!!', '2008-12-15 10:53:44.000000', '2008-12-15 10:55:40.000000', 0),
