(5132857, 744480, 43088, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the great comments.  This placed better than I thought it might. Other than adding the color it is pretty much exactly as shot.  I was at first concerned about the birds being too close to the edge of the frame but like the way they lead into it. Taken with a point and shoot I could not really see the birds in the monitor- I just tried point towards them and panning with them.  They become more secondary to the clouds.</td>', 'Thank you for all the great comments.  This placed better than I thought it might. Other than adding the color it is pretty much exactly as shot.  I was at first concerned about the birds being too close to the edge of the frame but like the way they lead into it. Taken with a point and shoot I could not really see the birds in the monitor- I just tried point towards them and panning with them.  They become more secondary to the clouds.', '2008-12-15 16:46:49.000000', NULL, 0),
