(5133343, 744605, 30861, '<td valign="top">This did very well, but I have to say I''m a little sorry it didn''t do better still. It has that something extra that makes it special. The DrAchoo shot was my runaway choice for blue, but I''d hoped to see this one yellow or red. Nice work!</td>', 'This did very well, but I have to say I''m a little sorry it didn''t do better still. It has that something extra that makes it special. The DrAchoo shot was my runaway choice for blue, but I''d hoped to see this one yellow or red. Nice work!', '2008-12-15 23:48:54.000000', NULL, 0),
