(5406659, 745620, 39427, '<td valign="top">Yeah congrats on 13th place and the high score but I think this image would have been even better if the original was less-exposed, and so (what i''m assuming) when you recovered the highlights it didn''t give you those strange grays and unnatural colors.  But again, what do i know, the people liked it!  Still obviously a beautiful shot</td>', 'Yeah congrats on 13th place and the high score but I think this image would have been even better if the original was less-exposed, and so (what i''m assuming) when you recovered the highlights it didn''t give you those strange grays and unnatural colors.  But again, what do i know, the people liked it!  Still obviously a beautiful shot', '2009-03-29 16:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5500768, 745282, 67145, '<td valign="top">OMG .. i applaud you .. or wotever the expression is ..<br/>i get self conscious taking pics in public .. feel awkward and uncomfortable .. seeing this motivates me to get over it .. coz my feelings are you can be an excellent photographer, but to be extraordinary you have to forget yourself and be daring .. of course imagination, talent, creativity, etc etc help .. <br/>i love your take on the challenge .. different and interesting .. <br/>you have a unique imagination and should go far .. very far . !!..:)<br/>i''d be interested to know where this placed ... probably a ribbon or a hm seeing you got the dq ..??..:)<br/></td>', 'OMG .. i applaud you .. or wotever the expression is ..i get self conscious taking pics in public .. feel awkward and uncomfortable .. seeing this motivates me to get over it .. coz my feelings are you can be an excellent photographer, but to be extraordinary you have to forget yourself and be daring .. of course imagination, talent, creativity, etc etc help .. i love your take on the challenge .. different and interesting .. you have a unique imagination and should go far .. very far . !!..:)i''d be interested to know where this placed ... probably a ribbon or a hm seeing you got the dq ..??..:)', '2009-05-26 18:24:34.000000', NULL, 0),
