(5505142, 745480, 106576, '<td valign="top">I like the fog BELOW the sun like that! I don''t recall seeing that before. The fog seems to give it an ethereal or mysterious kind of look especially with the foreground on the dark side; nice!<br/>Capturing the sun is hard to do! I know because I wasted about three rolls of film in film days on just one sunset and pretty much all bad, so congrats. on that!</td>', 'I like the fog BELOW the sun like that! I don''t recall seeing that before. The fog seems to give it an ethereal or mysterious kind of look especially with the foreground on the dark side; nice!Capturing the sun is hard to do! I know because I wasted about three rolls of film in film days on just one sunset and pretty much all bad, so congrats. on that!', '2009-05-29 20:58:43.000000', NULL, 0),
